00 Miliar GEMS Raih Pinjaman USD42 Juta Biayai Proyek Elektrifikasi Tambang Borneo Cimory (CMRY) Suntik Modal Rp325 Miliar ke Anak Usaha, Salah Satunya Produsen Kanzler SOFA Siapkan Pendanaan Rp131 Miliar untuk Proyek WTE hingga 2028 SILO Investasi Teknologi Medis, AI dan Robotik Disebut Tak Gantikan Peran Dokter', 'https://img.idxchannel.com/media/500/images/idx/2026/01/22/DPUM_dok_Dua_Putra.png', '2026-09-19 06:07:51.069+00', null, null, ARRAY['DPUM'], null, null, null, '2026-09-19 06:07:51.618093+00', '2026-09-19 06:07:52.464+00', null, null, '2026-09-19 06:07:51.069+00', false, 'CORPORATE_ACTION', 'Ekspansi tersebut mendapat dukungan dari pengendali baru perseroan, PT Rama Indonesia yang merupakan bagian dari Unirama Group', 'https://www.idxchannel.com/', null, 'PASS', null), ('27cefb00-73f1-4eec-9c86-cc231c453de3', 'https://market.bisnis.com/read/20260920/7/2005588/waspadai-sentimen-the-fed-ihsg-pekan-depan-rawan-uji-level-6290', 'Caution Over Fed Sentiment as Indonesia’s Composite Index May Test 6,290 Next Week', 'The article warns that hawkish Fed sentiment could push the Indonesia Composite Index (IHSG) to test the 6,290‑6,370 range next week. MNC Sekuritas places the index in wave iv of wave (c) on the black label, with support at 6,279 and 6,201 and resistance at 6,585 and 6,633, and notes that staying above 6,370 could allow a rise to 6,541‑6,581. IHSG fell 1.53% to 6,441,159 on Friday, with market capitalization down 1.58% to Rp11,266 trillion, average daily transaction value down 6.95% to Rp15.22 trillion, and foreign investors net‑selling Rp1.79 trillion (cumulative Rp74.36 trillion in 2026). MNC Sekuritas recommends buying on weakness PT Buana Listya Tama Tbk (BULL), PT Kalbe Farma Tbk (KLBF) and PT Telkom Indonesia Tbk (TLKM), and a buy for PT Bank Central Asia Tbk (BBCA).', 'https://images.bisnis.com/thumb/posts/2026/09/20/2005588/whatsapp-image-2026-08-14-at-09.30.46_1786675242.jpg?w=368&h=208', '2026-09-20 08:33:00+00', 'energy', ARRAY['oil-gas-coal','pharmaceuticals-health-care-research','telecommunication','banks'], ARRAY['BULL.JK','KLBF.JK','TLKM.JK','BBCA.JK'], ARRAY['Market Sentiment','Central Bank','Foreign Investment','Bullish'], '{"future":2,"dividend":0,"ownership":0,"technical":1,"valuation":0,"financials":0,"management":0,"sustainability":0}', '{"body":"The article warns that hawkish Fed sentiment could push the Indonesia Composite Index (IHSG) to test the 6,290‑6,370 range next week. MNC Sekuritas places the index in wave iv of wave (c) on the black label, with support at 6,279 and 6,201 and resistance at 6,585 and 6,633, and notes that staying above 6,370 could allow a rise to 6,541‑6,581. IHSG fell 1.53% to 6,441,159 on Friday, with market capitalization down 1.58% to Rp11,266 trillion, average daily transaction value down 6.95% to Rp15.22 trillion, and foreign investors net‑selling Rp1.79 trillion (cumulative Rp74.36 trillion in 2026). MNC Sekuritas recommends buying on weakness PT Buana Listya Tama Tbk (BULL), PT Kalbe Farma Tbk (KLBF) and PT Telkom Indonesia Tbk (TLKM), and a buy for PT Bank Central Asia Tbk (BBCA).","tags":["Market Sentiment","Central Bank","Foreign Investment","Bullish"],"title":"Caution Over Fed Sentiment as Indonesia’s Composite Index May Test 6,290 Next Week","sector":"energy","source":"https://market.bisnis.com/read/20260920/7/2005588/waspadai-sentimen-the-fed-ihsg-pekan-depan-rawan-uji-level-6290","symbols":["BULL.JK","KLBF.JK","TLKM.JK","BBCA.JK"],"dimension":{"future":2,"dividend":0,"ownership":0,"technical":1,"valuation":0,"financials":0,"management":0,"sustainability":0},"thumbnail":"https://images.bisnis.com/thumb/posts/2026/09/20/2005588/whatsapp-image-2026-08-14-at-09.30.46_1786675242.jpg?w=368&h=208","timestamp":"2026-09-20T08:33:00","sub_sector":["oil-gas-coal","pharmaceuticals-health-care-research","telecommunication","banks"]}', '2026-09-21 01:00:10.881891+00', '2026-09-21 01:00:10.881891+00', '93a52bb7-fda1-4d45-8b20-21812bcfb569', 3, '2026-09-20 08:33:00+00', false, null, null, null, 0, 'PASS', null), ('33d1f616-b0b0-4b00-ba23-ffd639415a9b', 'https://www.idxchannel.com/market-news/aset-kb-bank-tumbuh-1271-persen-jadi-rp8611-triliun-di-awal-2026', 'Aset KB Bank Tumbuh 12,71 Persen Jadi Rp86,11 Triliun di Awal 2026', 'Advertisement IDX Channel Market news Aset KB Bank Tumbuh 12,71 Persen Jadi Rp86,11 Triliun di Awal 2026 Market news Shifa Nurhaliza Putri 19/09/2026 09:21 WIB KB Bank mencatat pertumbuhan aset sebesar 12,71 persen secara tahunan (year-on-year/yoy) menjadi Rp86,11 triliun pada Semester I 2026. Aset KB Bank Tumbuh 12,71 Persen Jadi Rp86,11 Triliun di Awal 2026. (Foto: Ilustrasi) A A A IDXChannel – PT Bank KB Indonesia Tbk (KB Bank) mencatat pertumbuhan aset sebesar 12,71 persen secara tahunan (year-on-year/yoy) menjadi Rp86,11 triliun pada Semester I 2026. Pertumbuhan aset tersebut sejalan dengan penguatan intermediasi dan pendanaan perseroan. Total kredit yang disalurkan KB Bank mencapai Rp44,97 triliun atau tumbuh 4,38 persen yoy. Baca Juga: KB Bank (BBKP) Catat Laba Bersih Rp10,7 Miliar pada Kuartal I-2026 Direktur Utama KB Bank Kunardy Darma Lie mengatakan pertumbuhan kredit dilakukan secara selektif dengan tetap mempertimbangkan kualitas aset dan profil risiko perseroan. “Kami terus memperkuat fundamental bisnis KB Bank melalui pertumbuhan yang terarah, penguatan struktur pendanaan, peningkatan kualitas aset, serta perbaikan kemampuan Bank dalam menghasilkan pendapatan. Setiap langkah strategis kami jalankan secara selektif dan terukur dengan tetap menjaga keseimbangan antara pertumbuhan bisnis, kualitas aset, dan keberlanjutan kinerja. Kami berharap penguatan fundamental ini dapat menjadi landasan bagi KB Bank untuk terus meningkatkan kontribusi kepada nasabah dan seluruh pemangku kepentingan,” ujar Kunardy. Baca Juga: KB Bank (BBKP) Targetkan Naik Kelas ke KBMI III di 2027 Dari sisi pendanaan, Dana Pihak Ketiga (DPK) KB Bank tumbuh 12,44 persen yoy menjadi Rp45,57 triliun. Dana murah atau Current Account and Savings Account (CASA) juga meningkat 15,25 persen yoy menjadi Rp14,71 triliun. Pertumbuhan CASA tersebut membuat rasio CASA KB Bank berada di level 32,27 persen, atau masih di atas 30 persen. Perseroan menyebut perkembangan tersebut mencerminkan upaya memperkuat struktur dan efisiensi pendanaan. Dari sisi pendapatan, Net Interest Income (NII) KB Bank tumbuh 54,44 persen yoy menjadi Rp695 miliar pada Semester I 2026. Net Interest Margin (NIM) juga meningkat menjadi 1,96 persen dari 1,33 persen pada periode yang sama tahun sebelumnya. Kenaikan NII dan NIM tersebut menunjukkan adanya perbaikan dalam pengelolaan aset produktif dan struktur pendanaan perseroan. Sementara itu, kualitas aset KB Bank turut mengalami perbaikan. Hal tersebut tercermin dari rasio Loan at Risk (LAR) yang turun menjadi 21,93 persen dari 24,45 persen pada Semester I 2025. Perbaikan kualitas aset menjadi bagian dari strategi perseroan dalam menjaga pertumbuhan kredit secara selektif dan terukur, sekaligus mempertahankan kualitas portofolio. Halaman : 1 2 Your browser does not support the audio tag. LISTEN SHARE Follow Saluran Whatsapp IDX Channel untuk Update Berita Ekonomi Follow Follow Berita IDX Channel di Google News TAG: KB Bank BBKP Aset Laporan keuangan Saham Tim Editor Shifa Nurhaliza Putri Reporter Shifa Nurhaliza Putri Editor Berita Rekomendasi Kemenkeu Finalisasi Pengalihan Utang dan Saham Whoosh, Tegaskan Tidak Akan Bebani APBN Berita Terkait Bursa Asia Menguat, Investor Cermati Kebijakan Suku Bunga Global 18/09/2026 09:00 WIB Bursa Asia Menguat usai The Fed Naikkan Suku Bunga 17/09/2026 09:09 WIB Modal Global Tak Lagi Betah di AS, Indonesia Punya Peluang 16/09/2026 06:34 WIB Menkeu Baru Suahasil Utamakan Kredibilitas Fiskal, Saham Jangka Panjang Jadi Pilihan 15/09/2026 13:20 WIB Bursa Asia Tertekan Jelang Keputusan The Fed dan BoJ 15/09/2026 09:12 WIB Saham SoftBank Anjlok 13 Persen, Tertekan Seruan untuk Perlambat Pengembangan AI 14/09/2026 10:29 WIB Berita Lainnya Aset KB Bank Tumbuh 12,71 Persen Jadi Rp86,11 Triliun di Awal 2026 19/09/2026 09:21 WIB Pembiayaan Bermasalah Pindar Didominasi Kelompok Usia 19-34 Tahun 19/09/2026 08:58 WIB Kemenhaj Rancang Anggaran 2027 Lebih Realistis 19/09/2026 08:53 WIB Pendapatan Negara Tumbuh 25,4 Persen, Belanja APBN Tembus Rp2.295,7 Triliun 19/09/2026 08:34 WIB Intip Deretan Saham Raup Cuan Selama Sepekan, SEMA Pimpin Top Gainers 19/09/2026 08:33 WIB Prabowo Dijadwalkan Hadiri Puncak Peringatan 100 Tahun Gontor Hari Ini 19/09/2026 08:17 WIB Advertisement Advertisement Populer Berita Utama Haji Isam Resmi Caplok Bayan, Saham BYAN, JARR hingga TEBE Terbang Rebalancing FTSE, Saham BSDE hingga SCMA Tertekan di Menit Akhir Nasib Saham Summarecon (SMRA) usai Presdir Ditangkap KPK, Masih Menarik? 10 Saham Top Gainer Perdagangan Jumat 18 September 2026, Ada BYAN hingga CAMP Minat Investasi Emas Meningkat, HSBC Indonesia Hadirkan Reksa Dana Syariah Aset KB Bank Tumbuh 12,71 Persen Jadi Rp86,11 Triliun di Awal 2026 Intip Deretan Saham Raup Cuan Selama Sepekan, SEMA Pimpin Top Gainers IHSG Koreksi 1,53 Persen Sepekan, BEI Laporkan Penurunan Transaksi dan Aksi CSR Jelang Akhir Pekan IHSG Ditutup Melemah, Kapitalisasi Pasar Jadi Rp11.266 Triliun Wall Street Berakhir Variatif, Indeks Nasdaq', 'https://img.idxchannel.com/media/500/images/idx/2025/07/29/KB_Bank.JPG', '2026-09-19 02:34:44.66+00', null, null, ARRAY['BBKP'], null, null, null, '2026-09-19 02:34:45.181589+00', '2026-09-19 02:34:46.497+00', null, null, '2026-09-19 02:34:44.66+00', false, 'SINGLE_STOCK', 'KB Bank mencatat pertumbuhan aset sebesar 12,71 persen secara tahunan (year-on-year/yoy) menjadi Rp86,11 triliun pada Semester I 2026.', 'https://www.idxchannel.com/', null, 'PASS', null), ('3dcd34b0-25a1-4b48-ae49-db0c2c51331e', 'https://emitennews.com/news/emiten-keluarga-nursalim-scnp-siap-guyur-pasar-19233-juta-saham', 'PT Selaras Citra Nusantara Perkasa Tbk (SCNP) to Sell 192.33 Million Treasury Shares on the Indonesia Stock Exchange', 'PT Selaras Citra Nusantara Perkasa Tbk (SCNP) announced it will sell its entire treasury stock of 192,334,900 shares, representing 7.69% of its paid-up capital, on the Indonesia Stock Exchange between 25 September 2026 and 21 April 2028, with a daily cap of 20% (38,466,980 shares) and a minimum offer price of Rp156 per share (or the prior-day close/90-day average less up to a 7.5% discount). The expected gross proceeds of about Rp30 billion at the floor price will be used to strengthen working capital and raise the free-float to the BEI-required minimum of 15%, while PT Victoria Sekuritas Indonesia will act as the selling agent.', 'https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789713867.jpg?25119ab', '2026-09-18 13:45:00+00', 'consumer-cyclicals', ARRAY['household-goods'], ARRAY['SCNP.JK'], ARRAY['Ownership','Capital & Funding','Bullish'], '{"future":1,"dividend":0,"ownership":2,"technical":0,"valuation":0,"financials":2,"management":0,"sustainability":0}', '{"body":"PT Selaras Citra Nusantara Perkasa Tbk (SCNP) announced it will sell its entire treasury stock of 192,334,900 shares, representing 7.69% of its paid-up capital, on the Indonesia Stock Exchange between 25 September 2026 and 21 April 2028, with a daily cap of 20% (38,466,980 shares) and a minimum offer price of Rp156 per share (or the prior-day close/90-day average less up to a 7.5% discount). The expected gross proceeds of about Rp30 billion at the floor price will be used to strengthen working capital and raise the free-float to the BEI-required minimum of 15%, while PT Victoria Sekuritas Indonesia will act as the selling agent.","tags":["Ownership","Capital & Funding","Bullish"],"title":"PT Selaras Citra Nusantara Perkasa Tbk (SCNP) to Sell 192.33 Million Treasury Shares on the Indonesia Stock Exchange","sector":"consumer-cyclicals","source":"https://emitennews.com/news/emiten-keluarga-nursalim-scnp-siap-guyur-pasar-19233-juta-saham","symbols":["SCNP.JK"],"dimension":{"future":1,"dividend":0,"ownership":2,"technical":0,"valuation":0,"financials":2,"management":0,"sustainability":0},"thumbnail":"https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789713867.jpg?25119ab","timestamp":"2026-09-18T13:45:00","sub_sector":["household-goods"]}', '2026-09-18 12:11:13.696773+00', '2026-09-18 12:11:13.696773+00', '71ca3d88-32c0-406d-9a03-1ae7e9a7074d', 1, '2026-09-18 13:45:00+00', false, null, null, null, 0, 'PASS', null), ('417b1784-995b-4f90-92c7-e9d23a8c688e', 'https://www.idxchannel.com/market-news/usai-sepakat-caplok-bayan-byan-gurita-bisnis-haji-isam-makin-melebar', 'Usai Sepakat Caplok Bayan (BYAN), Gurita Bisnis Haji Isam Makin Melebar', 'Advertisement IDX Channel Market news Usai Sepakat Caplok Bayan (BYAN), Gurita Bisnis Haji Isam Makin Melebar Market news TIM RISET IDX CHANNEL 20/09/2026 09:09 WIB Kesepakatan akuisisi saham PT Bayan Resources Tbk (BYAN) membuka babak baru ekspansi bisnis Andi Syamsuddin Arsyad alias Haji Isam. Usai Sepakat Caplok Bayan (BYAN), Gurita Bisnis Haji Isam Makin Melebar. (Foto: Jhonlinmagz) A A A IDXChannel - Kesepakatan akuisisi saham PT Bayan Resources Tbk (BYAN) membuka babak baru ekspansi bisnis Andi Syamsuddin Arsyad alias Haji Isam. Dari batu bara, bisnis Haji Isam kini membentang ke sawit, biodiesel, infrastruktur tambang, mineral hingga industri makanan. Melalui kendaraan investasinya, PT Jhonlin Baratama, Haji Isam telah menandatangani perjanjian jual beli saham bersyarat atau Conditional Sale and Purchase Agreement (CSPA) dengan pemegang saham pengendali BYAN, taipan Low Tuck Kwong dan sang putri Elaine Low. Baca Juga: Istana Bantah Kabar Haji Isam Jadi Koordinator Penanganan Karhutla Kalimantan Berdasarkan keterbukaan informasi BYAN pada Kamis (17/9/2026), perjanjian yang ditandatangani pada 16 September tersebut mencakup pengalihan 10.000.000.500 saham BYAN atau sekitar 30 persen dari saham beredar. Penyelesaian transaksi masih menunggu pemenuhan sejumlah kondisi pendahuluan. Kabar tersebut langsung membuat riuh pasar saham. Pada perdagangan Jumat (18/9/2026), saham BYAN ditutup melonjak 19,96 persen ke Rp13.825 per unit atau menyentuh auto rejection atas (ARA). Dalam sepekan, saham BYAN telah menguat 11,94 persen. Baca Juga: Haji Isam Dirumorkan Tawar 62 Persen Saham BYAN Rp52 Triliun, Diskon 80 Persen Efeknya turut terasa pada sejumlah emiten yang terafiliasi dengan Grup Jhonlin. Saham PT Dana Brata Luhur Tbk (TEBE) naik 5,85 persen menjadi Rp2.080 per unit, sementara PT Pradiksi Gunatama Tbk (PGUN) dan PT Jhonlin Agro Raya Tbk (JARR) masing-masing terkoreksi 5,22 persen dan 14,08 persen akibat aksi ambil untung. Halaman : 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 Your browser does not support the audio tag. LISTEN SHARE Follow Saluran Whatsapp IDX Channel untuk Update Berita Ekonomi Follow Follow Berita IDX Channel di Google News TAG: BYAN Bayan Resources Haji Isam Jhonlin Low Tuck Kwong Tim Editor TIM RISET IDX CHANNEL Reporter Aldo Fernando Editor Berita Rekomendasi 10 Saham Top Gainer Perdagangan Jumat 18 September 2026, Ada BYAN hingga CAMP Berita Terkait IHSG Ditutup Melemah 0,3 Persen, Saham JARR-PACK Anjlok 18/09/2026 16:15 WIB IHSG Dibuka Menguat ke 6.512, BYAN-MYOH Pimpin Top Gainers 18/09/2026 09:28 WIB Haji Isam Resmi Caplok Bayan, Saham BYAN, JARR hingga TEBE Terbang 18/09/2026 09:15 WIB Low Tuck Kwong dan Putrinya Sepakat Lepas Saham BYAN ke Haji Isam 17/09/2026 19:50 WIB IHSG Ditutup Menguat 0,4 Persen, Saham TEBE-JARR Melonjak 17/09/2026 16:15 WIB Bayan Resources (BYAN) Tetapkan Keadaan Kahar usai Gagal Dapat Persetujuan RKAB 14/09/2026 18:38 WIB Berita Lainnya Usai Sepakat Caplok Bayan (BYAN), Gurita Bisnis Haji Isam Makin Melebar 20/09/2026 09:09 WIB Menteri Ekonomi ASEAN Bertemu di Filipina, Bahas Pakta Perdagangan ATIGA 20/09/2026 09:03 WIB OpenAI Targetkan Pendapatan Naik 10 Kali Lipat pada 2030 20/09/2026 08:03 WIB Saudi Aramco Batalkan Pengiriman Minyak ke Eropa hingga Oktober 20/09/2026 07:37 WIB Menkeu AS dan Wakil PM China Akan Gelar Pertemuan di Markas JPMorgan 20/09/2026 07:05 WIB AS Klaim 1 Miliar Barel Minyak Berhasil Lewati Selat Hormuz 20/09/2026 06:26 WIB Advertisement Advertisement Populer Berita Utama Demutualisasi Bergulir, OJK Batasi Kepemilikan Saham Bursa Efek Maksimal 5 Persen Aset KB Bank Tumbuh 12,71 Persen Jadi Rp86,11 Triliun di Awal 2026 Enam Petinggi TOWR Kompak Lego Saham Senilai Rp98,04 Miliar Induk Frisian Flag Bakal Jadi Pengendali Baru Ultrajaya (ULTJ), Begini Prospeknya Rupiah Sepekan Melemah 0,83 Persen Dibayangi Geopolitik dan Isu El Nino Usai Sepakat Caplok Bayan (BYAN), Gurita Bisnis Haji Isam Makin Melebar IHSG Pekan Depan Masih Rawan Terkoreksi Uji 6.290-6.370 Wall Street Pekan Depan: Komentar Pejabat The Fed hingga Pertemuan Trump-Xi Jinping Jadi Sorotan YUPI Siapkan Empat Opsi Penuhi Aturan Free Float 15 Persen Enam Petinggi TOWR Kompak Lego Saham Senilai Rp98,04 Miliar', 'https://img.idxchannel.com/media/500/images/idx/2026/09/20/Haji_Isam_-_Jhonlinmagz_web--.jpg', '2026-09-20 02:12:59.18+00', null, null, ARRAY['BYAN'], null, null, null, '2026-09-20 02:12:59.777028+00', '2026-09-20 02:12:59.777028+00', null, null, '2026-09-20 06:07:09+00', false, 'CORPORATE_ACTION', 'Kesepakatan akuisisi saham PT Bayan Resources Tbk (BYAN) membuka babak baru ekspansi bisnis Andi Syamsuddin Arsyad alias Haji Isam.', 'https://www.idxchannel.com/', 10, 'GENERATE', 'Berita memiliki catalyst akuisisi yang sangat kuat, data kuantitatif spesifik (10 miliar saham/30% kepemilikan), ticker jelas, dan dampak langsung terhadap harga saham (ARA).'), ('4324a016-c041-4366-b90c-1da31326a047', 'https://emitennews.com/news/h-isam-caplok-30-persen-saham-byan-meledak', 'H Isam acquires 30% of Bayan Resources (BYAN) as shares jump', 'H Isam, through Jhonlin Baratama, is acquiring a 30 percent stake in Bayan Resources (BYAN). The conditional sale and purchase agreement (CSPA) signed on 16 September 2026 covers the purchase of 10,000,000,500 BYAN shares and involves Low Tuck Kwong and Elaine Low with Jhonlin Baratama. Based on the closing price of Rp11,525 per share on 17 September 2026, the transaction is valued at roughly Rp115.25 trillion, and BYAN shares rose 1.54 percent (175 points) to Rp11,525. Bayan Resources said the transaction does not create material negative impact on its operations, legal matters, financial condition, or business continuity.', 'https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789655212.jpg?25119ab', '2026-09-17 21:27:00+00', 'energy', ARRAY['oil-gas-coal'], ARRAY['BYAN.JK'], ARRAY['Mergers & Acquisitions','Ownership','Bullish'], '{"future":0,"dividend":0,"ownership":2,"technical":0,"valuation":1,"financials":0,"management":0,"sustainability":0}', '{"body":"H Isam, through Jhonlin Baratama, is acquiring a 30 percent stake in Bayan Resources (BYAN). The conditional sale and purchase agreement (CSPA) signed on 16 September 2026 covers the purchase of 10,000,000,500 BYAN shares and involves Low Tuck Kwong and Elaine Low with Jhonlin Baratama. Based on the closing price of Rp11,525 per share on 17 September 2026, the transaction is valued at roughly Rp115.25 trillion, and BYAN shares rose 1.54 percent (175 points) to Rp11,525. Bayan Resources said the transaction does not create material negative impact on its operations, legal matters, financial condition, or business continuity.","tags":["Mergers & Acquisitions","Ownership","Bullish"],"title":"H Isam acquires 30% of Bayan Resources (BYAN) as shares jump","sector":"energy","source":"https://emitennews.com/news/h-isam-caplok-30-persen-saham-byan-meledak","symbols":["BYAN.JK"],"dimension":{"future":0,"dividend":0,"ownership":2,"technical":0,"valuation":1,"financials":0,"management":0,"sustainability":0},"thumbnail":"https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789655212.jpg?25119ab","timestamp":"2026-09-17T21:27:00","sub_sector":["oil-gas-coal"]}', '2026-09-18 03:17:19.846276+00', '2026-09-18 03:17:19.846276+00', '6b73e037-ad0f-4943-8c10-a1842c6df0c6', 2, '2026-09-17 21:27:00+00', false, null, null, null, 0, 'PASS', null), ('4aff222a-ff93-4ef2-942b-80f7d15ae82c', 'https://emitennews.com/news/emiten-distributor-alat-berat-hitachi-hexa-sahkan-kepengurusan-baru', 'PT Hexindo Adiperkasa Tbk (HEXA) confirms new board of directors and commissioners', 'PT Hexindo Adiperkasa Tbk (HEXA), the listed distributor of Hitachi heavy‑equipment, confirmed the appointment of a new board of directors and new members of the board of commissioners at its annual general meeting on 17 September 2026. The AGM, overseen by corporate secretary Listiana A. Kurniawati, set directors’ terms until the 2027 AGM and commissioners’ terms until the 2029 AGM, replacing the resignations of Yasumasa Zaizen and Akihiro Yoshida with Koji Sato and Junji Fukagawa while adjusting the commissioners’ lineup. The company affirmed that the governance changes will not affect HEXA’s operations, legal standing, financial condition, or business continuity.', 'https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789887055.jpg?25119ab', '2026-09-20 15:31:00+00', 'industrials', ARRAY['industrial-goods'], ARRAY['HEXA.JK'], ARRAY['Executive Changes','Shareholders General Meeting'], '{"future":0,"dividend":0,"ownership":0,"technical":0,"valuation":0,"financials":0,"management":2,"sustainability":0}', '{"body":"PT Hexindo Adiperkasa Tbk (HEXA), the listed distributor of Hitachi heavy‑equipment, confirmed the appointment of a new board of directors and new members of the board of commissioners at its annual general meeting on 17 September 2026. The AGM, overseen by corporate secretary Listiana A. Kurniawati, set directors’ terms until the 2027 AGM and commissioners’ terms until the 2029 AGM, replacing the resignations of Yasumasa Zaizen and Akihiro Yoshida with Koji Sato and Junji Fukagawa while adjusting the commissioners’ lineup. The company affirmed that the governance changes will not affect HEXA’s operations, legal standing, financial condition, or business continuity.","tags":["Executive Changes","Shareholders General Meeting"],"title":"PT Hexindo Adiperkasa Tbk (HEXA) confirms new board of directors and commissioners","sector":"industrials","source":"https://emitennews.com/news/emiten-distributor-alat-berat-hitachi-hexa-sahkan-kepengurusan-baru","symbols":["HEXA.JK"],"dimension":{"future":0,"dividend":0,"ownership":0,"technical":0,"valuation":0,"financials":0,"management":2,"sustainability":0},"thumbnail":"https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789887055.jpg?25119ab","timestamp":"2026-09-20T15:31:00","sub_sector":["industrial-goods"]}', '2026-09-21 01:00:10.881891+00', '2026-09-21 01:00:10.881891+00', '93a52bb7-fda1-4d45-8b20-21812bcfb569', 2, '2026-09-20 15:31:00+00', false, null, null, null, 0, 'PASS', null), ('50c1dfe0-17b3-4ffe-921e-b8cf1f5a43d6', 'https://emitennews.com/news/sinyal-rkab-rampung-saham-byan-meroket-ara-1996-persen-di-sesi-i', 'RKAB signal completed, PT Bayan Resources Tbk (BYAN) surges 19.96% to Auto Reject Top (ARA) in Session I', 'PT Bayan Resources Tbk (BYAN) jumped 19.96% to reach the Auto Reject Top (ARA) level in the first session of trading on 18 September 2026 after the RKAB signal was completed. The stock opened at Rp13,825, rose 2,300 rupiah, with a volume of 8.88 million shares traded in 4,909 transactions for a total value of Rp122.66 muliar, while the broader IHSG fell 0.28% to 6,444. The rally followed BYAN’s disclosure that founder Low Tuck Kwong and his daughter Elaine Low signed a Conditional Share Purchase Agreement on 16 September 2026 with PT Jhonlin Baratama, which will acquire 10,000,000,500 ordinary shares, roughly 30% of BYAN, and PT Jhonlin Baratama is part of Jhonlin Group. Earlier, BYAN announced force majeure for its subsidiaries Tiwa Abadi (TA), Tanur Jaya (TJ) and Fajar Sakti Prima (FSP) pending the revision of their 2026 RKAB, a process the Ministry’s Dirjen Minerba expects to complete within the week.', 'https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789705623.jpg?25119ab', '2026-09-18 11:30:00+00', 'energy', ARRAY['oil-gas-coal'], ARRAY['BYAN.JK'], ARRAY['Market Sentiment','Mergers & Acquisitions','Ownership','Bullish'], '{"future":1,"dividend":0,"ownership":2,"technical":2,"valuation":2,"financials":0,"management":1,"sustainability":0}', '{"body":"PT Bayan Resources Tbk (BYAN) jumped 19.96% to reach the Auto Reject Top (ARA) level in the first session of trading on 18 September 2026 after the RKAB signal was completed. The stock opened at Rp13,825, rose 2,300 rupiah, with a volume of 8.88 million shares traded in 4,909 transactions for a total value of Rp122.66 muliar, while the broader IHSG fell 0.28% to 6,444. The rally followed BYAN’s disclosure that founder Low Tuck Kwong and his daughter Elaine Low signed a Conditional Share Purchase Agreement on 16 September 2026 with PT Jhonlin Baratama, which will acquire 10,000,000,500 ordinary shares, roughly 30% of BYAN, and PT Jhonlin Baratama is part of Jhonlin Group. Earlier, BYAN announced force majeure for its subsidiaries Tiwa Abadi (TA), Tanur Jaya (TJ) and Fajar Sakti Prima (FSP) pending the revision of their 2026 RKAB, a process the Ministry’s Dirjen Minerba expects to complete within the week.","tags":["Market Sentiment","Mergers & Acquisitions","Ownership","Bullish"],"title":"RKAB signal completed, PT Bayan Resources Tbk (BYAN) surges 19.96% to Auto Reject Top (ARA) in Session I","sector":"energy","source":"https://emitennews.com/news/sinyal-rkab-rampung-saham-byan-meroket-ara-1996-persen-di-sesi-i","symbols":["BYAN.JK"],"dimension":{"future":1,"dividend":0,"ownership":2,"technical":2,"valuation":2,"financials":0,"management":1,"sustainability":0},"thumbnail":"https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789705623.jpg?25119ab","timestamp":"2026-09-18T11:30:00","sub_sector":["oil-gas-coal"]}', '2026-09-18 12:11:13.696773+00', '2026-09-18 12:11:13.696773+00', '71ca3d88-32c0-406d-9a03-1ae7e9a7074d', 2, '2026-09-18 11:30:00+00', false, null, null, null, 0, 'PASS', null), ('5731445a-a519-4ce1-b2a6-184759d57635', 'https://www.idxchannel.com/market-news/ultra-voucher-uvcr-mau-gelar-rights-issue-terbitkan-200-juta-saham-baru', 'Ultra Voucher (UVCR) Mau Gelar Rights Issue, Terbitkan 200 Juta Saham Baru', 'Advertisement IDX Channel Market news Ultra Voucher (UVCR) Mau Gelar Rights Issue, Terbitkan 200 Juta Saham Baru Market news Rohman Wibowo 19/09/2026 05:05 WIB PT Trimegah Karya Pratama Tbk (UVCR) atau Ultra Voucher bersiap melakukan penambahan modal tanpa memberikan hak memesan efek terlebih dahulu (PMTHMETD). Ultra Voucher (UVCR) Mau Gelar Rights Issue, Terbitkan 200 Juta Saham Baru. (Foto Istimewa) A A A IDXChannel - Emiten pelopor platform voucher digital, PT Trimegah Karya Pratama Tbk (UVCR) atau Ultra Voucher, bersiap melakukan penambahan modal tanpa memberikan hak memesan efek terlebih dahulu (PMTHMETD) atau rights issue. Mengacu pada keterbukaan informasi BEI, Jumat (18/9/2026), perseroan berencana menerbitkan sebanyak 200 juta saham baru atau setara maksimal 10 persen dari total modal yang ditempatkan dan disetor penuh. Direktur Ultra Voucher (UVCR) Riky memaparkan, langkah korporasi ini dirancang demi memperkokoh ketahanan finansial, sekaligus mengamankan kecukupan likuiditas operasional dan ekspansi usaha di masa mendatang. “Rencana penguatan permodalan ini menjadi salah satu langkah perseroan untuk memperkuat fondasi pendanaan guna mendukung pengembangan bisnis Ultra Voucher ke depannya,” ujar Riky dalam keterangan resmi, Jumat (18/9/2026). Realisasi aksi korporasi tersebut dijadwalkan bergulir dalam rentang waktu tiga hingga enam bulan terhitung sejak perseroan mengantongi persetujuan pemegang saham. Apabila tidak ada kendala agenda, Rapat Umum Pemegang Saham Luar Biasa (RUPSLB) untuk meminta mandat aksi emisi ini bakal dihelat pada 27 Oktober 2026. Halaman : 1 2 3 Your browser does not support the audio tag. LISTEN SHARE Follow Saluran Whatsapp IDX Channel untuk Update Berita Ekonomi Follow Follow Berita IDX Channel di Google News TAG: Rights Issue Rights Issue UVCR UVCR Ultra voucher Trimegah Karya Pratama Tim Editor Rohman Wibowo Reporter Dhera Arizona Pratiwi Editor Berita Rekomendasi BAJA Kantongi Restu OJK untuk Gelar Rights Issue Rp450 Miliar Berita Terkait Leyand (LAPD) Gelar Rights Issue, Pengendali Siap Inbreng Saham 13/09/2026 17:00 WIB BMAS Tetapkan Harga Rights Issue Rp350, Bidik Dana Rp1 Triliun 11/09/2026 10:05 WIB MGLV Patok Harga Final Right Issue Rp8.880, Berpotensi Raih Dana Rp2,5 Triliun 11/09/2026 09:42 WIB Potensi Pasar Masih Luas, Ultra Voucher (UVCR) Komitmen Lindungi Data Nasabah Pihak Ketiga 10/09/2026 18:27 WIB Ultra Voucher (UVCR) Cari Peluang Pertumbuhan dari Konvergensi Voucher hingga Loyalty 10/09/2026 17:31 WIB MGLV Revisi Asumsi Harga Rights Issue Jadi Rp8.400, Target Dana Rp2,4 Triliun 06/09/2026 14:03 WIB Berita Lainnya Ultra Voucher (UVCR) Mau Gelar Rights Issue, Terbitkan 200 Juta Saham Baru 19/09/2026 05:05 WIB Samudera Indonesia (SMDR) Suntik Modal ke Dua Anak Usaha Senilai Rp40,70 Miliar 19/09/2026 04:04 WIB Pencari Rumah Mulai Hitung Waktu Tempuh, Properti di Jakarta Pusat Kian Diminati 19/09/2026 03:03 WIB BPKN Desak Produsen Beras Fortifikasi Palsu Berikan Ganti Rugi kepada Konsumen 19/09/2026 02:02 WIB Lebih 44 Ribu Anak dari Keluarga Miskin Kembali Dapatkan Akses Sekolah Gratis 19/09/2026 01:01 WIB Saudi Aramco Bakal Tingkatkan Ekspor Minyak Jadi 60 Juta Barel di September-Oktober 19/09/2026 00:16 WIB Advertisement Advertisement Populer Berita Utama Haji Isam Resmi Caplok Bayan, Saham BYAN, JARR hingga TEBE Terbang Nasib Saham Summarecon (SMRA) usai Presdir Ditangkap KPK, Masih Menarik? Momentum Saham Hapsoro-Prajogo SINI, Seberapa Jauh Reli Berlanjut? Minat Investasi Emas Meningkat, HSBC Indonesia Hadirkan Reksa Dana Syariah 10 Saham Top Gainer Perdagangan Jumat 18 September 2026, Ada BYAN hingga CAMP Ultra Voucher (UVCR) Mau Gelar Rights Issue, Terbitkan 200 Juta Saham Baru Samudera Indonesia (SMDR) Suntik Modal ke Dua Anak Usaha Senilai Rp40,70 Miliar Wall Street Melemah Akibat Tekanan dari Kenaikan Imbal Hasil Obligasi Treasury Warren Buffett Mundur Sebagai Chairman Berkshire, Digantikan Putranya Howard Bank Amar Indonesia (AMAR) Perluas Layanan Keuangan ke Rantai Industri Perfilman', 'https://img.idxchannel.com/media/500/images/idx/2026/01/09/UVCR_gift_card.jpg', '2026-09-18 22:07:44.324+00', null, null, ARRAY['UVCR'], null, null, null, '2026-09-18 22:07:44.874857+00', '2026-09-18 22:07:46.096+00', null, null, '2026-09-18 22:07:44.324+00', false, 'IPO_RIGHTS_ISSUE', 'PT Trimegah Karya Pratama Tbk (UVCR) atau Ultra Voucher bersiap melakukan penambahan modal tanpa memberikan hak memesan efek terlebih dahulu (PMTHMETD).', 'https://www.idxchannel.com/', null, 'PASS', null), ('5a62b0a5-7800-4f38-95e5-b363859ad015', 'https://emitennews.com/news/reshuffle-kkgi-rombak-direksi-wimpi-salim-jadi-dirut-baru', 'PT Resource Alam Indonesia Tbk (KKGI) appoints Wimpi Salim as new President Director after board reshuffle', 'PT Resource Alam Indonesia Tbk (KKGI) held an extraordinary general meeting on 15 September 2026, confirmed by corporate secretary Leny on 16 September 2026, to restructure its board of directors. The meeting accepted the resignations of President Director Pintarso Adijanto and directors Winanto and Eddy, effective upon the meeting’s closure. Shareholders appointed Wimpi Salim, previously a director, as the new President Director for the remainder of the term and named Lucky Ciptadi Wibowo as a new director, with the revised board serving until the 2027 annual general meeting.', 'https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789627746.webp?25119ab', '2026-09-17 13:58:00+00', 'energy', ARRAY['oil-gas-coal'], ARRAY['KKGI.JK'], ARRAY['Executive Changes','Shareholders General Meeting'], '{"future":0,"dividend":0,"ownership":0,"technical":0,"valuation":0,"financials":0,"management":2,"sustainability":0}', '{"body":"PT Resource Alam Indonesia Tbk (KKGI) held an extraordinary general meeting on 15 September 2026, confirmed by corporate secretary Leny on 16 September 2026, to restructure its board of directors. The meeting accepted the resignations of President Director Pintarso Adijanto and directors Winanto and Eddy, effective upon the meeting’s closure. Shareholders appointed Wimpi Salim, previously a director, as the new President Director for the remainder of the term and named Lucky Ciptadi Wibowo as a new director, with the revised board serving until the 2027 annual general meeting.","tags":["Executive Changes","Shareholders General Meeting"],"title":"PT Resource Alam Indonesia Tbk (KKGI) appoints Wimpi Salim as new President Director after board reshuffle","sector":"energy","source":"https://emitennews.com/news/reshuffle-kkgi-rombak-direksi-wimpi-salim-jadi-dirut-baru","symbols":["KKGI.JK"],"dimension":{"future":0,"dividend":0,"ownership":0,"technical":0,"valuation":0,"financials":0,"management":2,"sustainability":0},"thumbnail":"https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789627746.webp?25119ab","timestamp":"2026-09-17T13:58:00","sub_sector":["oil-gas-coal"]}', '2026-09-18 03:17:19.846276+00', '2026-09-18 03:17:19.846276+00', '6b73e037-ad0f-4943-8c10-a1842c6df0c6', 3, '2026-09-17 13:58:00+00', false, null, null, null, 0, 'PASS', null), ('60329df6-cbd8-44e0-a712-7dcf35b74a92', 'https://emitennews.com/news/kalbe-farma-klbf-batal-gelar-buyback-saham-katanya-begini', 'PT Kalbe Farma Tbk (KLBF) Cancels Planned Share Buyback', 'PT Kalbe Farma Tbk (KLBF) announced on Tuesday, 15 September, through corporate secretary Maria Teresa Fabiola, that it is cancelling its previously disclosed share buyback program. The buyback, originally valued at Rp500 billion and scheduled from 16 September 2026 to 16 December 2026, was called off due to significantly fluctuating market conditions. The company estimated that the buyback would have reduced interest income by about Rp8.4 billion and would have raised pro‑forma earnings per share to Rp81.44 from Rp80.51 for the year ending 31 December 2025. On the day of the announcement, KLBF shares closed up 4.76% at 770, gaining 35 points.', 'https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789520626.jpg?25119ab', '2026-09-16 08:09:00+00', 'healthcare', ARRAY['pharmaceuticals-health-care-research'], ARRAY['KLBF.JK'], ARRAY['Stock Buyback','Financial Metrics','Capital & Funding','Market Sentiment','Bullish'], '{"future":0,"dividend":0,"ownership":0,"technical":2,"valuation":2,"financials":0,"management":0,"sustainability":0}', '{"body":"PT Kalbe Farma Tbk (KLBF) announced on Tuesday, 15 September, through corporate secretary Maria Teresa Fabiola, that it is cancelling its previously disclosed share buyback program. The buyback, originally valued at Rp500 billion and scheduled from 16 September 2026 to 16 December 2026, was called off due to significantly fluctuating market conditions. The company estimated that the buyback would have reduced interest income by about Rp8.4 billion and would have raised pro‑forma earnings per share to Rp81.44 from Rp80.51 for the year ending 31 December 2025. On the day of the announcement, KLBF shares closed up 4.76% at 770, gaining 35 points.","tags":["Stock Buyback","Financial Metrics","Capital & Funding","Market Sentiment","Bullish"],"title":"PT Kalbe Farma Tbk (KLBF) Cancels Planned Share Buyback","sector":"healthcare","source":"https://emitennews.com/news/kalbe-farma-klbf-batal-gelar-buyback-saham-katanya-begini","symbols":["KLBF.JK"],"dimension":{"future":0,"dividend":0,"ownership":0,"technical":2,"valuation":2,"financials":0,"management":0,"sustainability":0},"thumbnail":"https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789520626.jpg?25119ab","timestamp":"2026-09-16T08:09:00","sub_sector":["pharmaceuticals-health-care-research"]}', '2026-09-17 06:49:25.547472+00', '2026-09-17 06:49:25.547472+00', '0a2bebac-66e4-4d03-8239-b7aeed47405d', 6, '2026-09-16 08:09:00+00', false, null, null, null, 0, 'PASS', null), ('6a7a274c-a1ad-4d51-a5bd-602ec582698d', 'https://emitennews.com/news/aset-gemuk-laba-irsx-melambung-ratusan-persen', 'Folago (IRSX) posts first‑half 2026 net profit of Rp7.71 billion, up 587.97% YoY, as revenue climbs 173.92% to Rp275.08 billion.', 'Folago (IRSX) reported a net profit of Rp7.71 billion for the first half of 2026, a 587.97% increase from a loss of Rp1.58 billion a year earlier. Revenue rose 173.92% to Rp275.08 billion, while gross profit expanded to Rp44.22 billion and operating profit to Rp19.39 billion, reflecting higher cost of goods sold and administrative expenses. Total assets grew 43.73% to Rp517.77 billion and equity reached Rp317.27 billion, with liabilities rising to Rp200.49 billion. The shares traded at Rp398, down 0.5% on the day, and the company’s market capitalization stands at Rp2.47 trillion with a price‑earnings ratio of 78.85×.', 'https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789606134.jpg?25119ab', '2026-09-17 07:49:00+00', 'technology', ARRAY['software-it-services'], ARRAY['IRSX.JK'], ARRAY['Annual Report','Financial Metrics','Bullish'], '{"future":0,"dividend":0,"ownership":0,"technical":0,"valuation":1,"financials":2,"management":0,"sustainability":0}', '{"body":"Folago (IRSX) reported a net profit of Rp7.71 billion for the first half of 2026, a 587.97% increase from a loss of Rp1.58 billion a year earlier. Revenue rose 173.92% to Rp275.08 billion, while gross profit expanded to Rp44.22 billion and operating profit to Rp19.39 billion, reflecting higher cost of goods sold and administrative expenses. Total assets grew 43.73% to Rp517.77 billion and equity reached Rp317.27 billion, with liabilities rising to Rp200.49 billion. The shares traded at Rp398, down 0.5% on the day, and the company’s market capitalization stands at Rp2.47 trillion with a price‑earnings ratio of 78.85×.","tags":["Annual Report","Financial Metrics","Bullish"],"title":"Folago (IRSX) posts first‑half 2026 net profit of Rp7.71 billion, up 587.97% YoY, as revenue climbs 173.92% to Rp275.08 billion.","sector":"technology","source":"https://emitennews.com/news/aset-gemuk-laba-irsx-melambung-ratusan-persen","symbols":["IRSX.JK"],"dimension":{"future":0,"dividend":0,"ownership":0,"technical":0,"valuation":1,"financials":2,"management":0,"sustainability":0},"thumbnail":"https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789606134.jpg?25119ab","timestamp":"2026-09-17T07:49:00","sub_sector":["software-it-services"]}', '2026-09-17 06:49:25.547472+00', '2026-09-17 06:49:25.547472+00', '0a2bebac-66e4-4d03-8239-b7aeed47405d', 1, '2026-09-17 07:49:00+00', false, null, null, null, 0, 'PASS', null), ('6ed31e75-8d89-4e62-8b6a-d373079132c2', 'https://emitennews.com/news/gerakkan-saham-mbma-buyback-rp138-triliun', 'Merdeka Battery (MBMA) announces Rp1.38 trillion share buyback program', 'Merdeka Battery (MBMA) announced a share repurchase program valued at Rp1.38 trillion. The buyback, scheduled to run from 17 September 2026 to 16 December 2026, aims to absorb at least 1.46 billion shares over three months. The company expects the transaction will not reduce revenue, affect financing costs, or materially change pro‑forma earnings per share or the weighted‑average number of shares outstanding. In the most recent session, MBMA shares rose 0.81 % to Rp500 after a six‑month decline of 28.57 % from Rp700 on 17 March 2026.', 'https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789599757.png?25119ab', '2026-09-17 06:15:00+00', 'basic-materials', ARRAY['basic-materials'], ARRAY['MBMA.JK'], ARRAY['Stock Buyback','Bullish'], '{"future":0,"dividend":0,"ownership":0,"technical":0,"valuation":0,"financials":0,"management":0,"sustainability":0}', '{"body":"Merdeka Battery (MBMA) announced a share repurchase program valued at Rp1.38 trillion. The buyback, scheduled to run from 17 September 2026 to 16 December 2026, aims to absorb at least 1.46 billion shares over three months. The company expects the transaction will not reduce revenue, affect financing costs, or materially change pro‑forma earnings per share or the weighted‑average number of shares outstanding. In the most recent session, MBMA shares rose 0.81 % to Rp500 after a six‑month decline of 28.57 % from Rp700 on 17 March 2026.","tags":["Stock Buyback","Bullish"],"title":"Merdeka Battery (MBMA) announces Rp1.38 trillion share buyback program","sector":"basic-materials","source":"https://emitennews.com/news/gerakkan-saham-mbma-buyback-rp138-triliun","symbols":["MBMA.JK"],"dimension":{"future":0,"dividend":0,"ownership":0,"technical":0,"valuation":0,"financials":0,"management":0,"sustainability":0},"thumbnail":"https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789599757.png?25119ab","timestamp":"2026-09-17T06:15:00","sub_sector":["basic-materials"]}', '2026-09-17 06:49:25.547472+00', '2026-09-17 06:49:25.547472+00', '0a2bebac-66e4-4d03-8239-b7aeed47405d', 2, '2026-09-17 06:15:00+00', false, null, null, null, 0, 'PASS', null), ('707c9d69-12d8-439f-b55b-e6940e9f9783', 'https://www.liputan6.com/saham/read/8295339/pendapatan-blibli-rp-224-triliun-bisnis-tumbuh-34', 'Pendapatan Blibli Rp 22,4 Triliun, Bisnis Tumbuh 34%', 'PerbesarBlibli Store hadir di berbagai kota seperti tampak pada foto toko Blibli Store di Central Park Jakarta Barat.Liputan6.com, Jakarta - PT Global Digital Niaga Tbk atau Blibli mencatat pertumbuhan bisnis yang signifikan sepanjang 2025. Perusahaan yang dikenal sebagai salah satu pemain perdagangan omnichannel di Indonesia tersebut membukukan pendapatan neto konsolidasian sebesar Rp 22,4 triliun. Pendapatan tersebut tumbuh 34% secara tahunan (year-on-year/yoy) dibandingkan tahun sebelumnya. Pertumbuhan ini menunjukkan penguatan kinerja Blibli di tengah dinamika industri perdagangan digital dan perubahan perilaku konsumen. BACA JUGA:Emiten SMDR Menambah Modal Rp 40,7 Miliar untuk 2 Anak Usaha BACA JUGA:Pengendali Emiten WINR Lepas 20,74 Juta Saham, Ini Tujuannya BACA JUGA:UBS AG Lepas 1,19 Juta Saham CPIN Momentum pertumbuhan tersebut berlanjut hingga semester I 2026. Blibli mencatat pendapatan neto konsolidasian sebesar Rp 14,8 triliun, naik 55% dibandingkan Rp 9,6 triliun pada periode yang sama tahun sebelumnya. Advertisement Pertumbuhan tersebut ditopang oleh kontribusi dari berbagai segmen usaha, termasuk ritel dan segmen institusi. Ekspansi jaringan toko fisik juga menjadi bagian dari strategi perusahaan dalam memperkuat bisnis omnichannel. Chief Corporate Officer & Investor Relations Blibli, Eric Winarta, mengatakan pencapaian tersebut menjadi dorongan bagi perusahaan untuk terus memperkuat fundamental bisnis. “Pencapaian ini menjadi motivasi bagi kami untuk terus memperkuat fundamental usaha, menjaga disiplin operasional, serta senantiasa menghadirkan nilai yang relevan dan berkelanjutan bagi pelanggan dan mitra,” ujar Eric, dikutip Minggu (20/9/2026). Kinerja tersebut menjadi bagian dari upaya Blibli memperbesar skala bisnis sekaligus membangun ekosistem yang menghubungkan layanan digital dengan jaringan fisik. Dari E-Commerce ke Ekosistem: Cara Blibli Mengejar PertumbuhanPerbesarPT Global Digital Niaga Tbk melalui entitas anak PT Global Teknologi Niaga (GTNi) menggelar Blibli XPO 2026. (Dok Blibli)Pertumbuhan Blibli tidak hanya mengandalkan transaksi melalui platform digital. Perusahaan terus memperluas model bisnisnya dengan membangun ekosistem yang menggabungkan kanal online dan offline. Hingga akhir Juni 2026, Blibli telah mengoperasikan 326 toko elektronik konsumen, 14 toko elektronik rumah tangga, serta satu toko fesyen dan olahraga. Selain itu, ekosistem Blibli juga diperkuat dengan 60 gerai supermarket premium Ranch Market dan 38 home and living experience center yang dioperasikan Dekoruma. Perluasan jaringan fisik tersebut menjadi bagian dari strategi omnichannel. Dengan model ini, konsumen tidak hanya berinteraksi dengan Blibli melalui platform digital, tetapi juga dapat mengakses berbagai produk dan layanan melalui jaringan toko fisik. Strategi tersebut kemudian diperluas melalui ekosistem Blibli Tiket. Berbagai kebutuhan konsumen, mulai dari consumer electronics, perjalanan, groceries hingga home & living, diintegrasikan dalam satu ekosistem. Salah satu langkah terbaru adalah kolaborasi dengan PT Bank Central Asia Tbk atau BCA melalui peluncuran Kartu Kredit co-brand BCA Blibli Tiket Mastercard dengan tema “One Card More Rewards”. Kolaborasi ini menjadi bagian dari upaya Blibli menghubungkan aktivitas belanja, perjalanan dan kebutuhan gaya hidup dengan layanan finansial dalam satu pengalaman pelanggan. Dengan demikian, strategi Blibli tidak lagi semata-mata mengejar pertumbuhan transaksi e-commerce, tetapi memperbesar nilai dari ekosistem yang dibangun.AdvertisementBlibli Naik 13 Peringkat di Fortune Indonesia 100PerbesarChief Corporate Officer & Investor Relations Blibli Eric Winarta menerima penghargaan Fortune 100. (Dok BELI)Penguatan fundamental bisnis juga membawa Blibli naik cukup signifikan dalam Fortune Indonesia 100 tahun 2026. Blibli menempati posisi 59, naik 13 peringkat dibandingkan posisi 72 pada tahun sebelumnya. Fortune Indonesia 100 merupakan pemeringkatan 100 perusahaan terbesar di Indonesia berdasarkan pendapatan yang dicatatkan. Untuk masuk dalam daftar 2026, perusahaan harus memiliki pendapatan minimum sebesar Rp 12,31 triliun pada tahun buku 2025. Secara keseluruhan, pendapatan 100 perusahaan yang masuk dalam daftar tersebut mencapai kontribusi hingga 26,1% terhadap Produk Domestik Bruto (PDB) Indonesia sepanjang 2025. Bagi Blibli, peningkatan peringkat tersebut datang bersamaan dengan pertumbuhan pendapatan dan perluasan ekosistem bisnis. Perusahaan menyebut strategi ke depan akan diarahkan pada pertumbuhan yang sehat dan berkelanjutan. Eric mengatakan Blibli akan tetap berfokus pada produktivitas, penguatan margin, disiplin biaya dan integrasi ekosistem. “Ke depan, Blibli berkomitmen untuk fokus pada pertumbuhan yang sehat dan berkelanjutan melalui peningkatan produktivitas, penguatan margin, disiplin biaya, serta integrasi ekosistem yang semakin erat. Kami percaya bahwa perpaduan antara kapabilitas digital, jaringan fisik yang luas, dan pemahaman mendalam terhad', 'https://cdn0-production-images-kly.akamaized.net/XuLf69_prKPp8xrh_vMod1tB9rg=/1200x675/smart/filters:quality(75):strip_icc():format(jpeg)/kly-media-production/medias/4889391/original/098025900_1720698102-yy78899s3.jpg', '2026-09-20 04:14:16.144+00', null, null, ARRAY['BELI'], null, null, null, '2026-09-20 04:14:16.693386+00', '2026-09-20 04:14:16.693386+00', null, null, '2026-09-20 06:07:07+00', false, 'SINGLE_STOCK', 'Pendapatan Blibli tembus Rp 22,4 triliun, tumbuh 34%. Strategi omnichannel menjadi salah satu pendorong pertumbuhan bisnis.', 'liputan6.com', 9, 'GENERATE', 'Berita memiliki catalyst earnings yang sangat jelas dengan data kuantitatif pertumbuhan pendapatan 34% (2025) dan 55% (semester I 2026), serta ticker saham yang spesifik.'), ('761977a3-8e6c-4d34-a062-5083495c9821', 'https://www.idxchannel.com/market-news/bike-gandeng-perumda-pasar-jaya-kembangkan-pasar-minggu-nilai-investasi-rp1-triliun', 'BIKE Gandeng Perumda Pasar Jaya Kembangkan Pasar Minggu, Nilai Investasi Rp1 Triliun', 'Advertisement IDX Channel Market news BIKE Gandeng Perumda Pasar Jaya Kembangkan Pasar Minggu, Nilai Investasi Rp1 Triliun Market news Desi Angriani 19/09/2026 11:05 WIB PT Ratu Karya menjalin kerja sama pengembangan kawasan Pasar Minggu, Jakarta Selatan dengan Perumda Pasar Jaya. BIKE Gandeng Perumda Pasar Jaya Kembangkan Pasar Minggu, Nilai Investasi Rp1 Triliun (Foto: dok BIKE) A A A IDXChannel - PT Bhineka Inovasi Ketahanan Energi Tbk (BIKE) melalui anak usahanya, PT Ratu Karya menjalin kerja sama pengembangan kawasan Pasar Minggu, Jakarta Selatan dengan Perumda Pasar Jaya. Kerja sama tersebut dituangkan dalam penandatanganan Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) antara PT Ratu Karya dan Perumda Pasar Jaya pada 17 September 2026. Baca Juga: BIKE Catat Rugi Rp24,45 Miliar Terdampak Penghapusan Subsidi Motor Listrik Direktur Utama BIKE Eric Kusuma mengatakan, pembangunan dan pengembangan kawasan Pasar Minggu ini membutuhkan investasi sekitar Rp1 triliun. "Perjanjian Pelaksanaan Pembangunan Pasar MingguWilayah Jakarta Selatan diperkirakan menyerap nilai investasi senilai Rp1 triliun," ujar Eric dalam keterbukaan informasi BEI, Jumat (18/9/2026). Baca Juga: Ambil Alih BIKE, Penajam Makmur Siap Integrasi Bisnis Dalam rencana tersebut, kawasan Pasar Minggu akan dilengkapi dengan berbagai fasilitas penunjang, mulai dari kios dan los bagi pelaku usaha mikro, kecil, dan menengah (UMKM), rumah susun, rumah sakit, gedung perkantoran, pusat perbelanjaan, hingga food court. Halaman : 1 2 Your browser does not support the audio tag. LISTEN SHARE Follow Saluran Whatsapp IDX Channel untuk Update Berita Ekonomi Follow Follow Berita IDX Channel di Google News TAG: Bhineka Inovasi BIKE Pasa Minggu Pasar Jaya Tim Editor Desi Angriani Reporter Desi Angriani Editor Berita Rekomendasi Bantargebang Hanya Terima Sampah Residu Mulai Agustus, 146 Pasar Jaya Dilengkapi Tempat Sampah Pilah Berita Terkait BIKE Ubah Nama Perusahaan Jadi Bhineka Inovasi Ketahanan Energi 07/07/2026 08:38 WIB Hasilkan 500 Ton Sampah per Hari, Pasar di Jakarta Kini Wajib Lakukan Pemilahan Mandiri 11/05/2026 12:32 WIB Ambil Alih BIKE, Penajam Makmur Siap Integrasi Bisnis 22/04/2026 11:58 WIB Akuisisi Tuntas, Penajam Makmur Jaya Jadi Pengendali Baru BIKE 17/04/2026 05:05 WIB BIKE Catat Rugi Rp24,45 Miliar Terdampak Penghapusan Subsidi Motor Listrik 16/03/2026 04:00 WIB Stabilkan Harga Pangan, 500 Pasar Murah Siap Digelar di Jakarta Selama Ramadan 12/02/2026 09:01 WIB Berita Lainnya Daftar 10 Saham yang Merugi Sepekan, SAPX Merosot 39 Persen 19/09/2026 10:38 WIB Induk Frisian Flag Bakal Jadi Pengendali Baru Ultrajaya (ULTJ), Begini Prospeknya 19/09/2026 10:33 WIB Harga Emas di Pegadaian Kompak Naik, Antam 1 Gram Tembus Rp2,66 Juta 19/09/2026 09:44 WIB Aset KB Bank Tumbuh 12,71 Persen Jadi Rp86,11 Triliun di Awal 2026 19/09/2026 09:21 WIB Pembiayaan Bermasalah Pindar Didominasi Kelompok Usia 19-34 Tahun 19/09/2026 08:58 WIB Kemenhaj Rancang Anggaran 2027 Lebih Realistis 19/09/2026 08:53 WIB Advertisement Advertisement Populer Berita Utama Haji Isam Resmi Caplok Bayan, Saham BYAN, JARR hingga TEBE Terbang Rebalancing FTSE, Saham BSDE hingga SCMA Tertekan di Menit Akhir Nasib Saham Summarecon (SMRA) usai Presdir Ditangkap KPK, Masih Menarik? 10 Saham Top Gainer Perdagangan Jumat 18 September 2026, Ada BYAN hingga CAMP Minat Investasi Emas Meningkat, HSBC Indonesia Hadirkan Reksa Dana Syariah Daftar 10 Saham yang Merugi Sepekan, SAPX Merosot 39 Persen Induk Frisian Flag Bakal Jadi Pengendali Baru Ultrajaya (ULTJ), Begini Prospeknya Harga Emas di Pegadaian Kompak Naik, Antam 1 Gram Tembus Rp2,66 Juta Demutualisasi Bergulir, OJK Batasi Kepemilikan Saham Bursa Efek Maksimal 5 Persen Aset KB Bank Tumbuh 12,71 Persen Jadi Rp86,11 Triliun di Awal 2026', 'https://img.idxchannel.com/media/500/images/idx/2026/09/19/BIKE_dok_BIKE.JPG', '2026-09-19 04:08:41.461+00', null, null, ARRAY['BIKE'], null, null, null, '2026-09-19 04:08:42.041896+00', '2026-09-19 04:08:43.269+00', null, null, '2026-09-19 04:08:41.461+00', false, 'CORPORATE_ACTION', 'PT Ratu Karya menjalin kerja sama pengembangan kawasan Pasar Minggu, Jakarta Selatan dengan Perumda Pasar Jaya.', 'https://www.idxchannel.com/', null, 'PASS', null), ('82f0ae4f-89c5-4ab9-b3f7-0d474ae58d55', 'https://emitennews.com/news/emiten-kayu-ifii-tebar-dividen-interim-rp47-miliar-cair-oktober', 'PT Indonesia Fibreboard Industry Tbk (IFII) announces Rp47.06 billion interim dividend, payable in October 2026', 'PT Indonesia Fibreboard Industry Tbk (IFII) announced an interim cash dividend for FY 2026. The dividend totals Rp47.06 billion, or Rp5 per share, payable to shareholders of record. The payout is based on a net profit attributable to the parent of Rp78.12 billion, with retained earnings of Rp453.72 billion and total equity of Rp1.40 trillion as of 30 June 2026. Cum-dividend dates are set for 28 September (regular market) and 30 September 2026 (cash market), ex-dividend on 29 September and 1 October respectively, with payment scheduled for 15 October 2026.', 'https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789698861.jpg?25119ab', '2026-09-18 09:34:00+00', 'basic-materials', ARRAY['basic-materials'], ARRAY['IFII.JK'], ARRAY['Dividend Announcement','Financial Metrics','Bullish'], '{"future":0,"dividend":0,"ownership":0,"technical":0,"valuation":0,"financials":0,"management":0,"sustainability":0}', '{"body":"PT Indonesia Fibreboard Industry Tbk (IFII) announced an interim cash dividend for FY 2026. The dividend totals Rp47.06 billion, or Rp5 per share, payable to shareholders of record. The payout is based on a net profit attributable to the parent of Rp78.12 billion, with retained earnings of Rp453.72 billion and total equity of Rp1.40 trillion as of 30 June 2026. Cum-dividend dates are set for 28 September (regular market) and 30 September 2026 (cash market), ex-dividend on 29 September and 1 October respectively, with payment scheduled for 15 October 2026.","tags":["Dividend Announcement","Financial Metrics","Bullish"],"title":"PT Indonesia Fibreboard Industry Tbk (IFII) announces Rp47.06 billion interim dividend, payable in October 2026","sector":"basic-materials","source":"https://emitennews.com/news/emiten-kayu-ifii-tebar-dividen-interim-rp47-miliar-cair-oktober","symbols":["IFII.JK"],"dimension":{"future":0,"dividend":0,"ownership":0,"technical":0,"valuation":0,"financials":0,"management":0,"sustainability":0},"thumbnail":"https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789698861.jpg?25119ab","timestamp":"2026-09-18T09:34:00","sub_sector":["basic-materials"]}', '2026-09-18 07:01:14.175403+00', '2026-09-18 07:01:14.175403+00', '82361f38-7a9a-4de9-b049-ff9f9010f2d4', 1, '2026-09-18 09:34:00+00', false, null, null, null, 0, 'PASS', null), ('861bd168-03a3-4e97-a4c9-44cd33421157', 'https://market.bisnis.com/read/20260921/192/2005704/pupuk-indonesia-target-bangun-dan-revamp-8-pabrik-dalam-5-tahun', 'PT Pupuk Indonesia (Persero) targets building and revamping eight factories within five years', 'PT Pupuk Indonesia (Persero) announced a plan to construct and revamp eight fertilizer and chemical plants over the next five years to boost energy efficiency, production capacity and operational reliability. The company reported revenue rising from Rp81.6 trillion in 2024 to Rp90.4 trillion in 2025, lifting it to rank 14 in Fortune Indonesia 100 2026 and to the eighth‑largest BUMN by revenue, while its regional Fortune Southeast Asia 500 ranking improved to 68. Recent projects such as the revamp of Ammonia Plant‑2 in East Kalimantan cut gas consumption by more than 10%, and the firm plans new soda‑ash and methanol plants as part of its move toward an industrial and specialty chemicals powerhouse. Government regulations (Perpres No. 6/2025 and No. 113/2025) increased subsidized fertilizer distribution to 8.11 million tons (up 10.68%) and, by shifting the subsidy scheme to a marked‑to‑market basis, lowered the retail price of subsidized fertilizer by 20% since October 2025.', 'https://images.bisnis.com/thumb/posts/2026/09/21/2005704/pupuk_indonesia_1_1789944818.jpg?w=368&h=208', '2026-09-21 05:49:00+00', 'basic-materials', ARRAY['basic-materials'], ARRAY[], ARRAY['Business Expansion','Production & Operations','Government Policy','Subsidies & Incentives','Bullish'], '{"future":2,"dividend":0,"ownership":0,"technical":0,"valuation":0,"financials":2,"management":0,"sustainability":1}', '{"body":"PT Pupuk Indonesia (Persero) announced a plan to construct and revamp eight fertilizer and chemical plants over the next five years to boost energy efficiency, production capacity and operational reliability. The company reported revenue rising from Rp81.6 trillion in 2024 to Rp90.4 trillion in 2025, lifting it to rank 14 in Fortune Indonesia 100 2026 and to the eighth‑largest BUMN by revenue, while its regional Fortune Southeast Asia 500 ranking improved to 68. Recent projects such as the revamp of Ammonia Plant‑2 in East Kalimantan cut gas consumption by more than 10%, and the firm plans new soda‑ash and methanol plants as part of its move toward an industrial and specialty chemicals powerhouse. Government regulations (Perpres No. 6/2025 and No. 113/2025) increased subsidized fertilizer distribution to 8.11 million tons (up 10.68%) and, by shifting the subsidy scheme to a marked‑to‑market basis, lowered the retail price of subsidized fertilizer by 20% since October 2025.","tags":["Business Expansion","Production & Operations","Government Policy","Subsidies & Incentives","Bullish"],"title":"PT Pupuk Indonesia (Persero) targets building and revamping eight factories within five years","sector":"basic-materials","source":"https://market.bisnis.com/read/20260921/192/2005704/pupuk-indonesia-target-bangun-dan-revamp-8-pabrik-dalam-5-tahun","symbols":[],"dimension":{"future":2,"dividend":0,"ownership":0,"technical":0,"valuation":0,"financials":2,"management":0,"sustainability":1},"thumbnail":"https://images.bisnis.com/thumb/posts/2026/09/21/2005704/pupuk_indonesia_1_1789944818.jpg?w=368&h=208","timestamp":"2026-09-21T05:49:00","sub_sector":["basic-materials"]}', '2026-09-21 01:00:10.881891+00', '2026-09-21 01:00:10.881891+00', '93a52bb7-fda1-4d45-8b20-21812bcfb569', 1, '2026-09-21 05:49:00+00', false, null, null, null, 0, 'PASS', null), ('88c3eb2e-893f-405e-bb1a-c55bd499ed37', 'https://www.idxchannel.com/market-news/enam-petinggi-towr-kompak-lego-saham-senilai-rp9804-miliar', 'Enam Petinggi TOWR Kompak Lego Saham Senilai Rp98,04 Miliar', 'Advertisement IDX Channel Market news Enam Petinggi TOWR Kompak Lego Saham Senilai Rp98,04 Miliar Market news Rohman Wibowo 19/09/2026 15:05 WIB Aksi jual massal oleh direksi dan komisaris perseroan berlangsung saat saham TOWR berada dalam tren pelemahan. Enam Petinggi TOWR Kompak Lego Saham Senilai Rp98,04 Miliar (Foto: dok Freepik) A A A IDXChannel - Enam petinggi PT Sarana Menara Nusantara Tbk (TOWR) kompak melepas kepemilikan saham perseroan dengan total nilai Rp98,04 Miliar atau sebanyak 224,23 juta saham. Aksi jual massal oleh direksi dan komisaris perseroan berlangsung saat saham TOWR berada dalam tren pelemahan. Di mana pada penutupan perdagangan Jumat (18/9/2026) saham TOWR terkoreksi 6,33 persen ke posisi Rp414 per saham serta membukukan penurunan akumulatif sebesar 8,81 persen dalam lima hari perdagangan terakhir. Baca Juga: Konsolidasi BACH Dongkrak Pendapatan, Laba TOWR Tumbuh 12 Persen Jadi Rp1,85 Triliun Adapun empat direktur dan dua komisaris tercatat melepas kepemilikan mereka pada harga pelaksanaan Rp437 per saham pada 16 September 2026. Porsi terbesar oleh Direktur Utama TOWR, Ferdinandus Aming Santoso yang mendivestasi sebanyak 96,998 juta saham di harga Rp437 per saham dengan nilai Rp42,39 miliar. Baca Juga: Anak Usaha TOWR Raih Kredit Baru Rp1,5 Triliun dari CIMB Niaga Langkah ini memangkas portofolionya secara signifikan dari kepemilikan awal sebanyak 109,61 juta saham atau setara hak suara 0,18 persen, kini tersisa sekitar 12,61 juta saham yang mewakili porsi hak suara 0,0213 persen. Halaman : 1 2 3 Your browser does not support the audio tag. LISTEN SHARE Follow Saluran Whatsapp IDX Channel untuk Update Berita Ekonomi Follow Follow Berita IDX Channel di Google News TAG: TOWR Direksi Komisaris Divestasi Penjualan Saham Tim Editor Rohman Wibowo Reporter Desi Angriani Editor Berita Rekomendasi OJK Susun RPOJK, Pastikan Direksi dan Komisaris BEI Tetap Independen Usai Demutualisasi Berita Terkait Gandeng Omada, Anak Usaha Sarana Menara (TOWR) Jajaki Bisnis Wifi Generasi Baru 15/09/2026 20:29 WIB Adhi Karya (ADHI) Andalkan Divestasi Aset Perkuat Modal Kerja dan Bayar Utang 10/09/2026 04:00 WIB TOWR Kantongi Kontrak Jangka Panjang Lebih dari Rp100 Triliun 08/09/2026 13:04 WIB Rumor Merger MTEL-TBIG Muncul Lagi, Siapa Berpotensi Jadi Survivor? 28/08/2026 11:33 WIB Restrukturisasi Grup, Pengendali Ambil Alih 51,95 Persen Saham Anak Usaha SFAN 18/08/2026 11:17 WIB SFAN Alihkan 99,9 Persen Saham Mitra Usaha Indofund ke Pengendali 16/08/2026 17:03 WIB Berita Lainnya Enam Petinggi TOWR Kompak Lego Saham Senilai Rp98,04 Miliar 19/09/2026 15:05 WIB Prabowo Kesal dengan Perilaku Koruptor: Sudah Dikasih Kepercayaan, Nyolong 19/09/2026 14:58 WIB Perkuat Literasi, MNC Asset Management & Mirae Asset Sekuritas Gelar Investor Gathering 19/09/2026 14:35 WIB Rupiah Sepekan Melemah 0,83 Persen Dibayangi Geopolitik dan Isu El Nino 19/09/2026 14:05 WIB Bos DJP Tegaskan Tarif PPN Tak Naik di Era Suahasil 19/09/2026 13:33 WIB Pengendali Baru Masuk, DPUM Siapkan Ekspansi Rp100 Miliar 19/09/2026 13:05 WIB Advertisement Advertisement Populer Berita Utama Rebalancing FTSE, Saham BSDE hingga SCMA Tertekan di Menit Akhir 10 Saham Top Gainer Perdagangan Jumat 18 September 2026, Ada BYAN hingga CAMP Frisian Flag Masuk, Ultrajaya (ULTJ) Siap Tebar Dividen Spesial Minat Investasi Emas Meningkat, HSBC Indonesia Hadirkan Reksa Dana Syariah BEI Berencana Tambah Jam Perdagangan Saham hingga 30 Menit Enam Petinggi TOWR Kompak Lego Saham Senilai Rp98,04 Miliar Perkuat Literasi, MNC Asset Management & Mirae Asset Sekuritas Gelar Investor Gathering Rupiah Sepekan Melemah 0,83 Persen Dibayangi Geopolitik dan Isu El Nino Pengendali Baru Masuk, DPUM Siapkan Ekspansi Rp100 Miliar GEMS Raih Pinjaman USD42 Juta Biayai Proyek Elektrifikasi Tambang Borneo', 'https://img.idxchannel.com/media/500/images/idx/2025/08/04/Bagaimana_Cara_Investasi_Saham.jpg', '2026-09-19 08:08:54.392+00', null, null, ARRAY['TOWR'], null, null, null, '2026-09-19 08:08:54.535536+00', '2026-09-19 08:08:55.317+00', null, null, '2026-09-19 08:08:54.392+00', false, 'SINGLE_STOCK', 'Aksi jual massal oleh direksi dan komisaris perseroan berlangsung saat saham TOWR berada dalam tren pelemahan.', 'https://www.idxchannel.com/', null, 'PASS', null), ('8ab62f6f-7b70-4829-a846-f95141094116', 'https://www.idxchannel.com/market-news/gems-raih-pinjaman-usd42-juta-biayai-proyek-elektrifikasi-tambang-borneo', 'GEMS Raih Pinjaman USD42 Juta Biayai Proyek Elektrifikasi Tambang Borneo', 'Advertisement IDX Channel Market news GEMS Raih Pinjaman USD42 Juta Biayai Proyek Elektrifikasi Tambang Borneo Market news Desi Angriani 19/09/2026 12:35 WIB Pembiayaan ini akan digunakan untuk belanja modal proyek pembangunan elektrifikasi di area operasional tambang anak usaha. GEMS Raih Pinjaman USD42 Juta Biayai Proyek Elektrifikasi Tambang Borneo (Foto: dok GEMS) A A A IDXChannel - PT Golden Energy Mines Tbk (GEMS) melalui anak usahanya, PT Borneo Indobara (BIB) memperoleh fasilitas term loan hingga USD42 juta atau setara Rp745 miliar (kurs Rp17.758 per USD). Fasilitas pinjaman tersebut diperoleh dari PT Bank Mandiri (Persero) Tbk (BMRI) pada 16 September 2026 dengan jangka waktu lima tahun. Baca Juga: Siapa Pemilik Saham GEMS? Emiten Batu Bara, Intip Lokasi Konsesi dan Kinerjanya Pembiayaan ini akan digunakan untuk belanja modal (capital expenditure/capex) proyek pembangunan elektrifikasi di area operasional tambang Borneo Indobara. Manajemen GEMS menyebut, fasilitas ini akan mendukung pengembangan proyek elektrifikasi sekaligus menunjang pertumbuhan dan kinerja operasional perseroan maupun anak usaha. Baca Juga: Grup Sinarmas (GEMS) Habiskan Rp31,44 Miliar Eksplorasi Batu Bara di kuartal IV-2025 Sebelumnya pada Juli 2026, GEMS juga telah memperoleh pendanaan senilai total Rp5,5 triliun dari Bank Mandiri. Halaman : 1 2 Your browser does not support the audio tag. LISTEN SHARE Follow Saluran Whatsapp IDX Channel untuk Update Berita Ekonomi Follow Follow Berita IDX Channel di Google News TAG: Golden Energy GEMS Tambang borneo Tim Editor Desi Angriani Reporter Desi Angriani Editor Berita Rekomendasi GEMS Raih Pinjaman Rp5,5 Triliun untuk Modal Kerja Anak Usaha Berita Terkait Anak Usaha GEMS Raih Kredit Modal Rp4 Triliun dari Bank BRI 16/03/2026 20:09 WIB Grup Sinarmas (GEMS) Habiskan Rp31,44 Miliar Eksplorasi Batu Bara di kuartal IV-2025 12/01/2026 15:45 WIB Anak Usaha Golden Energy (GEMS) Peroleh Pinjaman dari Bank Mandiri (BMRI) Rp900 Miliar 10/12/2025 18:54 WIB Siapa Pemilik Saham GEMS? Emiten Batu Bara, Intip Lokasi Konsesi dan Kinerjanya 24/10/2025 12:10 WIB 11 Saham Milik Sinar Mas di Bursa Efek Indonesia, Intip Harga dan Market Cap-nya 06/10/2025 17:18 WIB 3 Saham Milik Franky Widjaja di Bursa Efek Indonesia, Intip Perkembangan Harganya 16/09/2025 14:16 WIB Berita Lainnya GEMS Raih Pinjaman USD42 Juta Biayai Proyek Elektrifikasi Tambang Borneo 19/09/2026 12:35 WIB Cimory (CMRY) Suntik Modal Rp325 Miliar ke Anak Usaha, Salah Satunya Produsen Kanzler 19/09/2026 12:03 WIB SOFA Siapkan Pendanaan Rp131 Miliar untuk Proyek WTE hingga 2028 19/09/2026 11:35 WIB SILO Investasi Teknologi Medis, AI dan Robotik Disebut Tak Gantikan Peran Dokter 19/09/2026 11:30 WIB Prabowo Naik Maung Hadiri 100 Tahun Gontor di Jatim 19/09/2026 11:19 WIB BIKE Gandeng Perumda Pasar Jaya Kembangkan Pasar Minggu, Nilai Investasi Rp1 Triliun 19/09/2026 11:05 WIB Advertisement Advertisement Populer Berita Utama Haji Isam Resmi Caplok Bayan, Saham BYAN, JARR hingga TEBE Terbang Rebalancing FTSE, Saham BSDE hingga SCMA Tertekan di Menit Akhir Nasib Saham Summarecon (SMRA) usai Presdir Ditangkap KPK, Masih Menarik? 10 Saham Top Gainer Perdagangan Jumat 18 September 2026, Ada BYAN hingga CAMP Minat Investasi Emas Meningkat, HSBC Indonesia Hadirkan Reksa Dana Syariah GEMS Raih Pinjaman USD42 Juta Biayai Proyek Elektrifikasi Tambang Borneo Cimory (CMRY) Suntik Modal Rp325 Miliar ke Anak Usaha, Salah Satunya Produsen Kanzler SOFA Siapkan Pendanaan Rp131 Miliar untuk Proyek WTE hingga 2028 SILO Investasi Teknologi Medis, AI dan Robotik Disebut Tak Gantikan Peran Dokter BIKE Gandeng Perumda Pasar Jaya Kembangkan Pasar Minggu, Nilai Investasi Rp1 Triliun', 'https://img.idxchannel.com/media/500/images/idx/2025/12/10/gems_ist.jpg', '2026-09-19 05:37:48.54+00', null, null, ARRAY['GEMS'], null, null, null, '2026-09-19 05:37:48.681995+00', '2026-09-19 05:37:49.513+00', null, null, '2026-09-19 05:37:48.54+00', false, 'CORPORATE_ACTION', 'Pembiayaan ini akan digunakan untuk belanja modal proyek pembangunan elektrifikasi di area operasional tambang anak usaha.', 'https://www.idxchannel.com/', null, 'PASS', null), ('8ac084af-476c-454f-bdce-e8c20dbaef8f', 'https://emitennews.com/news/stop-segmen-cetak-konvensional-epac-janji-hak-pekerja-dipenuhi', 'PT Megalestari Epack Sentosaraya Tbk (EPAC) to Halt Conventional Printing Segment, Promises Workers'' Rights Will Be Fulfilled', 'EPAC announced it will cease all conventional rotogravure printing operations by 31 December 2026 and affirmed that workers affected by the shutdown will receive their entitlements in accordance with Indonesian labor law. The rotogravure segment (MES) recorded a net loss of Rp7.84 billion, while the digital printing subsidiary PT Epac Flexibles Indonesia (EFI) posted a profit of Rp4.69 billion, resulting in a consolidated net loss of Rp2.84 billion through mid‑2026. Management projects that eliminating the MES segment will turn the loss into a net profit of about Rp1.61 billion and generate earnings per share of Rp0.51. EPAC also outlined a Rp59.1 billion capital expenditure plan for 2027, to be financed through leasing and a rights issue pending approval at an upcoming extraordinary shareholders’ meeting, and disclosed a mandatory tender offer by its controlling shareholder within the next 12 months under POJK No. 9/POJK.04/2018.', 'https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789519267.png?25119ab', '2026-09-16 07:45:00+00', 'basic-materials', ARRAY['basic-materials'], ARRAY['EPAC.JK'], ARRAY['Capital & Funding','Rights Issue','Shareholders General Meeting','Politics & Regulation','Bullish'], '{"future":2,"dividend":0,"ownership":1,"technical":0,"valuation":0,"financials":1,"management":0,"sustainability":0}', '{"body":"EPAC announced it will cease all conventional rotogravure printing operations by 31 December 2026 and affirmed that workers affected by the shutdown will receive their entitlements in accordance with Indonesian labor law. The rotogravure segment (MES) recorded a net loss of Rp7.84 billion, while the digital printing subsidiary PT Epac Flexibles Indonesia (EFI) posted a profit of Rp4.69 billion, resulting in a consolidated net loss of Rp2.84 billion through mid‑2026. Management projects that eliminating the MES segment will turn the loss into a net profit of about Rp1.61 billion and generate earnings per share of Rp0.51. EPAC also outlined a Rp59.1 billion capital expenditure plan for 2027, to be financed through leasing and a rights issue pending approval at an upcoming extraordinary shareholders’ meeting, and disclosed a mandatory tender offer by its controlling shareholder within the next 12 months under POJK No. 9/POJK.04/2018.","tags":["Capital & Funding","Rights Issue","Shareholders General Meeting","Politics & Regulation","Bullish"],"title":"PT Megalestari Epack Sentosaraya Tbk (EPAC) to Halt Conventional Printing Segment, Promises Workers'' Rights Will Be Fulfilled","sector":"basic-materials","source":"https://emitennews.com/news/stop-segmen-cetak-konvensional-epac-janji-hak-pekerja-dipenuhi","symbols":["EPAC.JK"],"dimension":{"future":2,"dividend":0,"ownership":1,"technical":0,"valuation":0,"financials":1,"management":0,"sustainability":0},"thumbnail":"https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789519267.png?25119ab","timestamp":"2026-09-16T07:45:00","sub_sector":["basic-materials"]}', '2026-09-17 06:49:25.547472+00', '2026-09-17 06:49:25.547472+00', '0a2bebac-66e4-4d03-8239-b7aeed47405d', 7, '2026-09-16 07:45:00+00', false, null, null, null, 0, 'PASS', null), ('8d334e67-2e19-44fb-84d3-368c8904d362', 'https://emitennews.com/news/penghuni-tetap-msci-laba-emiten-prajogo-ptro-meroket-ratusan-persen', 'Petrosea (PTRO), a permanent MSCI constituent, reports a 913% profit surge and completes acquisition of Sejahtera Terminal Logistik (STL)', 'Petrosea (PTRO) posted a massive increase in net profit for the first half of 2026 and announced the completion of its purchase of Sejahtera Terminal Logistik (STL). Net profit rose to USD10.78 million, up 913% year‑on‑year, with revenue climbing to USD543.98 million, a 59.55% increase, while equity grew to USD321.28 million and liabilities fell to USD1.20 billion. The acquisition, filed on 15 September 2026, was executed through PTRO’s subsidiaries Petrosea Engineering Procurement Construction and Rekakarsa Karya Nusantara for a total price of Rp880 million, giving Petrosea Engineering 99.80% of STL’s shares (1,497 shares) and Rekakarsa Karya 0.20% (3 shares). The deal is intended to strengthen PTRO’s logistics and port‑service operations and generate synergies.', 'https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789679456.jpg?25119ab', '2026-09-18 04:11:00+00', 'energy', ARRAY['oil-gas-coal'], ARRAY['PTRO.JK'], ARRAY['Financial Metrics','Mergers & Acquisitions','Business Expansion','Subsidiaries','Bullish'], '{"future":0,"dividend":0,"ownership":0,"technical":0,"valuation":0,"financials":2,"management":0,"sustainability":0}', '{"body":"Petrosea (PTRO) posted a massive increase in net profit for the first half of 2026 and announced the completion of its purchase of Sejahtera Terminal Logistik (STL). Net profit rose to USD10.78 million, up 913% year‑on‑year, with revenue climbing to USD543.98 million, a 59.55% increase, while equity grew to USD321.28 million and liabilities fell to USD1.20 billion. The acquisition, filed on 15 September 2026, was executed through PTRO’s subsidiaries Petrosea Engineering Procurement Construction and Rekakarsa Karya Nusantara for a total price of Rp880 million, giving Petrosea Engineering 99.80% of STL’s shares (1,497 shares) and Rekakarsa Karya 0.20% (3 shares). The deal is intended to strengthen PTRO’s logistics and port‑service operations and generate synergies.","tags":["Financial Metrics","Mergers & Acquisitions","Business Expansion","Subsidiaries","Bullish"],"title":"Petrosea (PTRO), a permanent MSCI constituent, reports a 913% profit surge and completes acquisition of Sejahtera Terminal Logistik (STL)","sector":"energy","source":"https://emitennews.com/news/penghuni-tetap-msci-laba-emiten-prajogo-ptro-meroket-ratusan-persen","symbols":["PTRO.JK"],"dimension":{"future":0,"dividend":0,"ownership":0,"technical":0,"valuation":0,"financials":2,"management":0,"sustainability":0},"thumbnail":"https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789679456.jpg?25119ab","timestamp":"2026-09-18T04:11:00","sub_sector":["oil-gas-coal"]}', '2026-09-18 03:17:19.846276+00', '2026-09-18 03:17:19.846276+00', '6b73e037-ad0f-4943-8c10-a1842c6df0c6', 1, '2026-09-18 04:11:00+00', false, null, null, null, 0, 'PASS', null), ('989c660b-d590-4643-8556-7e1ec39cec1f', 'https://emitennews.com/news/nawasena-caplok-6658-persen-saham-idea-langsung-meroket', 'Nawasena Nugra Investama (NNI) plans to acquire 66.58% of Idea Indonesia Akademika (IDEA), prompting IDEA shares to jump 9.68% to IDR 102.', 'Nawasena Nugra Investama (NNI) is negotiating to purchase 66.58% of Idea Indonesia Akademika (IDEA) – equivalent to 707.32 million shares – from current controller Idea Asia Investama (ISI), after which NNI will become the new controlling shareholder and must conduct a mandatory tender offer under POJK No. 9/POJK.04/2018. Following the announcement, IDEA’s stock surged 9.68% to IDR 102, a 56.92% rise over the past five days from IDR 65.', 'https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789534169.jpeg?25119ab', '2026-09-16 11:50:00+00', 'consumer-cyclicals', ARRAY['consumer-services'], ARRAY[], ARRAY['Mergers & Acquisitions','Ownership','Market Sentiment','Bullish'], '{"future":0,"dividend":0,"ownership":2,"technical":2,"valuation":2,"financials":0,"management":0,"sustainability":0}', '{"body":"Nawasena Nugra Investama (NNI) is negotiating to purchase 66.58% of Idea Indonesia Akademika (IDEA) – equivalent to 707.32 million shares – from current controller Idea Asia Investama (ISI), after which NNI will become the new controlling shareholder and must conduct a mandatory tender offer under POJK No. 9/POJK.04/2018. Following the announcement, IDEA’s stock surged 9.68% to IDR 102, a 56.92% rise over the past five days from IDR 65.","tags":["Mergers & Acquisitions","Ownership","Market Sentiment","Bullish"],"title":"Nawasena Nugra Investama (NNI) plans to acquire 66.58% of Idea Indonesia Akademika (IDEA), prompting IDEA shares to jump 9.68% to IDR 102.","sector":"consumer-cyclicals","source":"https://emitennews.com/news/nawasena-caplok-6658-persen-saham-idea-langsung-meroket","symbols":[],"dimension":{"future":0,"dividend":0,"ownership":2,"technical":2,"valuation":2,"financials":0,"management":0,"sustainability":0},"thumbnail":"https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789534169.jpeg?25119ab","timestamp":"2026-09-16T11:50:00","sub_sector":["consumer-services"]}', '2026-09-17 06:49:25.547472+00', '2026-09-17 06:49:25.547472+00', '0a2bebac-66e4-4d03-8239-b7aeed47405d', 3, '2026-09-16 11:50:00+00', false, null, null, null, 0, 'PASS', null), ('9d0a760d-4bc5-4729-8b47-73d8f15d0d45', 'https://www.liputan6.com/saham/read/8294856/emiten-silo-bakal-akuisisi-14-perusahaan-rumah-sakit', 'Emiten SILO Bakal Akuisisi 14 Perusahaan Rumah Sakit', 'PerbesarPengunjung melintas di dekat monitor perkembangan saham di Bursa Efek Indonesia, Jakarta (Liputan6.com/Immanuel Antonius)Liputan6.com, Jakarta - PT Siloam International Hospitals Tbk (SILO) mengumumkan akan melakukan transaksi pengambilalihan atau akusisi saham yang telah ditempatkan dan disetor pada 14 perusahaan terdiri dari perusahaan sasaran tahap pertama dan perusahaan sasaran tahap kedua yang memiliki properti rumah sakit yang selama ini dioperasikan perseroan dari entitas anak First Real Estate Investment Trust atau First REIT. Mengutip keterbukaan informasi Bursa Efek Indonesia (BEI), Sabtu, (19/9/2026), First REIT adalah sebuah trust bidang investasi real estat fasilitas kesehatan yang berfokus pada investasi dalam berbagai aset kesehatan dan real estat terkait kesehatan dengan imbal balik akretif di dalam dan di luar Asia. BACA JUGA:Emiten IFII Tebar Dividen Interim Rp 5 per Saham BACA JUGA:Tokocrypto Soroti Pergeseran Persepsi Kripto di Indonesia BACA JUGA:IHSG Hari Ini Tergelincir ke 6.441, Analis Ungkap Penyebabnya Di Indonesia, First REIT beroperasi melalui entitas anaknya yang dimiliki secara langsung atau tidak langsung dan Perseroan merupakan operator dari objek-objek yang dimiliki First REIT di Indonesia. Advertisement Perseroan akan melakukan implementasi rencana transaksi dalam dua tahap. Pertama, transaksi tahap pertama berupa pengambilalihan atas delapan perusahaan sasaran tahap pertama berdasarkan perjanjian jual beli bersyarat atau PPJB. Kedua, transaksi tahap kedua berupa pengambilalihan atas enam perusahaan sasaran tahap kedua yang akan dilaksanakan apabila opsi jual yang diberikan perseroan berdasarkan perjanjian opsi jual dilaksanakan oleh pemegang opsi terkait. Rencana transaksi merupakan transaksi material sebagaimana diatur dalam POJK No. 17/2020 karena nilai Rencana Transaksi melebihi 50% dari ekuitas Perseroan sebagaimana tercantum dalam laporan keuangan 31 Maret 2026. Perseroan berencana untuk melakukan rencana transaksi atas saham-saham dalam Perusahaan Sasaran yang akan diambilalih berdasarkan PPJB dan Perjanjian Opsi Jual. Penyelesaian transaksi tahap pertama rencananya mulai dilaksanakan pada atau sebelum 28 September 2026, atau pada tanggal lain yang dapat disepakati secara tertulis oleh para pihak dalam PPJB. Keseluruhan Transaksi tahap pertama diperkirakan diselesaikan oleh para pihak pada Oktober 2026. Alasan TransaksiPerbesarSeorang pria melihat ponselnya di depan layar yang menampilkan Indeks Harga Saham Gabungan (IHSG), yang anjlok signifikan selama pembukaan pasar, di gedung Bursa Efek Indonesia di Jakarta pada Rabu 13 Mei 2026. (BAY ISMOYO/AFP)Emiten SILO menjelaskan, sebagian signifikan dari infrastruktur rumah sakit yang dioperasikan Perseroan pada saat ini, yaitu sebanyak 14 rumah sakit, tidak dimiliki oleh Perseroan melainkan disewa dari entitas entitas anak First Real Estate Investment Trust (First REIT) berdasarkan perjanjian sewa jangka panjang. Berdasarkan perjanjian-perjanjian sewa tersebut, beban sewa yang harus dibayarkan Perseroan terdiri atas komponen sewa dasar dan komponen sewa variabel yang besarnya dikaitkan dengan kinerja pendapatan usaha rumah sakit yang bersangkutan. Dengan demikian, setiap peningkatan kinerja pendapatan yang dihasilkan dari upaya operasional dan investasi klinis Perseroan secara langsung meningkatkan pula beban sewa yang menjadi kewajiban Perseroan kepada pemilik aset. Berdasarkan pertimbangan tersebut, Perseroan memandang pengambilalihan portofolio aset rumah sakit yang selama ini disewa dari First REIT sebagai langkah strategis yang sejalan dengan arah pengembangan usaha dan dapat menciptakan nilai jangka panjang bagi Perseroan. AdvertisementManfaat TransaksiPerbesarLayar monitor menunjukkan pergerakan pasar saham di lantai Bursa Efek Indonesia menjelang aktivitas perdagangan, Jakarta pada Senin 9 Februari 2026. Indeks Harga Saham Gabungan (IHSG) balik ke level 8.000 pada penutupan perdagangan, Senin (9/2/2026). (BAY ISMOYO/AFP)Rencana transaksi memberikan penguasaan penuh atas aset sehingga strategi aset dan strategi klinis dapat diselaraskan, memungkinkan optimalisasi pemanfaatan dan pengembangan infrastruktur, serta merealisasikan nilai aset yang selama ini belum termanfaatkan. Dari sisi keuangan, rencana transaksi memungkinkan Perseroan menikmati secara lebih penuh peningkatan kinerja rumah sakit, mengurangi eksposur terhadap kenaikan beban sewa dan risiko perpanjangan masa sewa, serta mengalihkan pengeluaran sewa menjadi kepemilikan aset produktif yang dapat memperkuat neraca dan nilai aset Perseroan dalam jangka panjang. Sumber pendanaan Total nilai transaksi itu diperkirakan mencapai Rp 6,90 triliun. Perseroan akan memakai fasilitas pinjaman perbankan dan sumber internal untuk melakukan transaksi pengambilalihan saham. Perseroan juga akan menggelar Rapat Umum Pemegang Saham Luar Biasa (RUPSLB) pada 22 September 2026 untuk meminta persetujuan pemegang saham terkait rencana transaksi pengambilalihan saham.Sah', 'https://cdn0-production-images-kly.akamaized.net/xtTlykj6QI6Kx3smVjDbaOgz6-E=/488x0:3309x1589/1200x675/filters:quality(75):strip_icc():format(jpeg):watermark(kly-media-production/assets/images/watermarks/liputan6/watermark-gray-landscape-new.png,1100,20,0)/kly-media-production/medias/1040537/original/091207600_1446442504-20151102-IHSG-Masih-Berkutat-di-Zona-Merah-Jakarta4.jpg', '2026-09-18 23:06:41.443+00', null, null, ARRAY['SILO'], null, null, null, '2026-09-18 23:06:41.57636+00', '2026-09-18 23:06:42.409+00', null, null, '2026-09-18 23:06:41.443+00', false, 'CORPORATE_ACTION', 'PT Siloam International Hospitals Tbk (SILO) akan akuisisi saham 14 rumah sakit senilai Rp 6,9 triliun. Pendanaan akuisisi memakai pinjaman dan internal.', 'liputan6.com', null, 'PASS', null), ('a7919c15-051e-4138-91c5-d296d51529a6', 'https://emitennews.com/news/saldo-laba-2025-menggunung-kkgi-kucurkan-dividen-tunai-rp20-per-saham', 'PT Resource Alam Indonesia Tbk (KKGI) declares cash dividend of Rp20 per share, totalling Rp97.47 billion, funded by USD180.4 million retained earnings', 'PT Resource Alam Indonesia Tbk (KKGI) will distribute a cash dividend of Rp20 per share. The dividend amounts to Rp97,466,588,000 and is drawn from retained earnings of USD180,406 million reported as of 31 December 2025. The payout was approved at the shareholders meeting on 15 September 2026, with a record date of 25 September 2026; for the regular market, cum dividend is on 23 September 2026 and ex dividend on 24 September 2026, while for the cash market cum dividend is on 25 September 2026 and ex dividend on 28 September 2026. The cash dividend will be paid to eligible shareholders on 15 October 2026.', 'https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789626278.jpg?25119ab', '2026-09-17 13:26:00+00', 'energy', ARRAY['oil-gas-coal'], ARRAY['KKGI.JK'], ARRAY['Dividend Announcement','Bullish'], '{"future":0,"dividend":0,"ownership":0,"technical":0,"valuation":0,"financials":0,"management":0,"sustainability":0}', '{"body":"PT Resource Alam Indonesia Tbk (KKGI) will distribute a cash dividend of Rp20 per share. The dividend amounts to Rp97,466,588,000 and is drawn from retained earnings of USD180,406 million reported as of 31 December 2025. The payout was approved at the shareholders meeting on 15 September 2026, with a record date of 25 September 2026; for the regular market, cum dividend is on 23 September 2026 and ex dividend on 24 September 2026, while for the cash market cum dividend is on 25 September 2026 and ex dividend on 28 September 2026. The cash dividend will be paid to eligible shareholders on 15 October 2026.","tags":["Dividend Announcement","Bullish"],"title":"PT Resource Alam Indonesia Tbk (KKGI) declares cash dividend of Rp20 per share, totalling Rp97.47 billion, funded by USD180.4 million retained earnings","sector":"energy","source":"https://emitennews.com/news/saldo-laba-2025-menggunung-kkgi-kucurkan-dividen-tunai-rp20-per-saham","symbols":["KKGI.JK"],"dimension":{"future":0,"dividend":0,"ownership":0,"technical":0,"valuation":0,"financials":0,"management":0,"sustainability":0},"thumbnail":"https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789626278.jpg?25119ab","timestamp":"2026-09-17T13:26:00","sub_sector":["oil-gas-coal"]}', '2026-09-18 03:17:19.846276+00', '2026-09-18 03:17:19.846276+00', '6b73e037-ad0f-4943-8c10-a1842c6df0c6', 4, '2026-09-17 13:26:00+00', false, null, null, null, 0, 'PASS', null), ('a81e6850-d7d2-44cf-a011-712ad8a70ef1', 'https://www.emitennews.com/news/emiten-kayu-ifii-tebar-dividen-interim-rp47-miliar-cair-oktober', 'Emiten Kayu IFII Tebar Dividen Interim Rp47 Miliar, Cair Oktober', 'Redaktur Suara Merdeka, liputan berita DPR, Ekuin, Pasar Modal dan Kepresidenan RI : 0 PT Indonesia Fibreboard Industry Tbk (IFII) mengumumkan rencana pembagian dividen tunai interim untuk periode tahun buku 2026.(Foto: Dok) EmitenNews.com - PT Indonesia Fibreboard Industry Tbk (IFII) mengumumkan rencana pembagian dividen tunai interim untuk periode tahun buku 2026. Perseroan mengalokasikan total nilai dividen sebesar Rp47,06 miliar atau setara dengan Rp5 per saham kepada pemegang saham yang berhak. Keputusan pembagian dividen ini mengacu pada penetapan Direksi yang telah memperoleh persetujuan dari Dewan Komisaris Perseroan pada tanggal 16 September 2026. Rencana aksi korporasi tersebut resmi disampaikan manajemen melalui surat Keterbukaan Informasi Bursa Efek Indonesia (BEI) bernomor 078/CORSEC-IFII/IX/2026 yang dirilis hari ini, Jumat (18/9). Direksi Perseroan mencatat bahwa pembagian dividen interim ini didasarkan pada laporan data keuangan per 30 Juni 2026. Berdasarkan laporan tersebut, emiten produsen papan serat berkerapatan sedang (medium density fibreboard) ini mengantongi laba bersih yang dapat diatribusikan kepada entitas induk sebesar Rp78,12 miliar. Selain itu, perseroan mencatatkan saldo laba ditahan yang tidak dibatasi penggunaannya sebesar Rp453,72 miliar dan total ekuitas mencapai Rp1,40 triliun. Manajemen menetapkan tanggal cum dividen di pasar reguler dan pasar negosiasi jatuh pada 28 September 2026, diikuti ex dividen pada 29 September 2026. Sementara itu, cum dividen di pasar tunai dijadwalkan pada 30 September 2026 dan ex dividen pada 1 Oktober 2026. Tanggal daftar pemegang saham (DPS) yang berhak atas dividen tunai dipatok pada 30 September 2026 pukul 16.00 WIB. Pemegang saham yang terdaftar akan menerima pembayaran dividen interim secara langsung pada tanggal 15 Oktober 2026.(*) Siapkan PMTHMETD, Ultra Voucher (UVCR) Kuatkan Modal Kembangkan Bisnis Haji Isam Masuk, Low Tuck Kwong Rintis BYAN dari Bisnis Kontraktor Sugeng dan Rudy Perkuat Mitrabahtera (MBSS), Ini Posisinya Usai RUPSLB Nextier Jualan MGLV Lagi, Volume 7 Juta Unit, Harga Setara Pertalite Induk Frisian Flag Caplok Ultrajaya (ULTJ), Saham Langsung Melesat! Saham Big Cap Runtuh di Sesi I (18/9), Ternyata Asing Net Sell Rp1,14T Haji Isam Masuk, Low Tuck Kwong Rintis BYAN dari Bisnis Kontraktor Dibeking 4 Klien Kakap, Saham Prajogo Tembus Top 10 MSCI Small Cap Cuma 3, Ini Saham Indonesia yang Masuk Indeks High Dividend Yield MSCI Kejar Free Float, Yupi Indo (YUPI) Siapkan 4 Opsi, Salah Satunya ESOP Belum Bagikan Dividen, Venteny Fortuna (VTNY) Ungkap Fokusnya Bukan Sekadar Formalitas, Intip Ketatnya Penjurian EmitenNews Awards! Copyright 2026 emitennews.com All rights reserved', 'https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789698861.jpg?25119ab', '2026-09-18 13:58:32.4+00', null, null, ARRAY['IFII'], null, null, null, '2026-09-18 13:58:32.967993+00', '2026-09-18 14:38:02.295+00', null, null, '2026-09-18 13:58:32.4+00', false, 'CORPORATE_ACTION', 'PT Indonesia Fibreboard Industry Tbk (IFII) mengumumkan rencana pembagian dividen tunai interim untuk periode tahun buku 2026', null, null, 'PASS', null), ('b80a9cad-d649-4f0a-b148-b3bceaa6d341', 'https://emitennews.com/news/h-isam-datang-byan-auto-bebas-force-majeure', 'H Isam’s Jhonlin Baratama acquires 30% of Bayan Resources (BYAN), easing force‑majeure concerns', 'On 16 September 2026, H Isam’s entity Jhonlin Baratama signed a conditional sale and purchase agreement to acquire 10,000,000,500 ordinary shares of Bayan Resources (BYAN), representing a 30% stake. The shares were bought from Low Tuck Kwong and Elaine Low at an estimated transaction value of about Rp114.5 trillion, based on BYAN’s closing price of Rp11,450 per share, and the deal is subject to conditions precedent. The acquisition makes Jhonlin Baratama a major shareholder of BYAN and is expected to lift the company’s force‑majeure status, with BYAN’s director stating the transaction does not create material negative impact on operations, legal matters, financial condition, or continuity.', 'https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789690836.jpg?25119ab', '2026-09-18 07:30:00+00', 'energy', ARRAY['oil-gas-coal'], ARRAY['BYAN.JK'], ARRAY['Mergers & Acquisitions','Ownership','Bullish'], '{"future":1,"dividend":0,"ownership":2,"technical":0,"valuation":1,"financials":0,"management":0,"sustainability":0}', '{"body":"On 16 September 2026, H Isam’s entity Jhonlin Baratama signed a conditional sale and purchase agreement to acquire 10,000,000,500 ordinary shares of Bayan Resources (BYAN), representing a 30% stake. The shares were bought from Low Tuck Kwong and Elaine Low at an estimated transaction value of about Rp114.5 trillion, based on BYAN’s closing price of Rp11,450 per share, and the deal is subject to conditions precedent. The acquisition makes Jhonlin Baratama a major shareholder of BYAN and is expected to lift the company’s force‑majeure status, with BYAN’s director stating the transaction does not create material negative impact on operations, legal matters, financial condition, or continuity.","tags":["Mergers & Acquisitions","Ownership","Bullish"],"title":"H Isam’s Jhonlin Baratama acquires 30% of Bayan Resources (BYAN), easing force‑majeure concerns","sector":"energy","source":"https://emitennews.com/news/h-isam-datang-byan-auto-bebas-force-majeure","symbols":["BYAN.JK"],"dimension":{"future":1,"dividend":0,"ownership":2,"technical":0,"valuation":1,"financials":0,"management":0,"sustainability":0},"thumbnail":"https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789690836.jpg?25119ab","timestamp":"2026-09-18T07:30:00","sub_sector":["oil-gas-coal"]}', '2026-09-18 07:01:14.175403+00', '2026-09-18 07:01:14.175403+00', '82361f38-7a9a-4de9-b049-ff9f9010f2d4', 3, '2026-09-18 07:30:00+00', false, null, null, null, 0, 'PASS', null), ('bdaede88-0528-45c9-9444-c7f60f8f8952', 'https://emitennews.com/news/bentuk-usaha-patungan-drma-perluas-bisnis-ev-via-mitra-global', 'Dharma Polimetal (DRMA) forms joint venture with Minth Group to expand EV component business', 'Dharma Polimetal (DRMA) and Minth Group have created a joint venture, PT Dharma Minth Indonesia (DMI), to produce electric‑vehicle components. The venture, backed by an initial Rp45 billion investment, will be owned 51 % by Minth Group and 49 % by Dharma Group. DMI will focus on manufacturing battery housings, body and chassis structures with aluminum extrusion, and plastic component designs at a plant in MM2100 Industrial Town Cibitung, slated to start operations in the second quarter of 2027. The partnership aims to transfer technology to Dharma Polimetal and generate a new revenue growth engine while leveraging Minth Group’s network of more than 80 global automotive brands.', 'https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789513739.png?25119ab', '2026-09-16 06:30:00+00', 'consumer-cyclicals', ARRAY['automobiles-components'], ARRAY['DRMA.JK'], ARRAY['Joint Venture','Business Expansion','Capital & Funding','Production & Operations','Bullish'], '{"future":1,"dividend":0,"ownership":0,"technical":0,"valuation":0,"financials":0,"management":0,"sustainability":0}', '{"body":"Dharma Polimetal (DRMA) and Minth Group have created a joint venture, PT Dharma Minth Indonesia (DMI), to produce electric‑vehicle components. The venture, backed by an initial Rp45 billion investment, will be owned 51 % by Minth Group and 49 % by Dharma Group. DMI will focus on manufacturing battery housings, body and chassis structures with aluminum extrusion, and plastic component designs at a plant in MM2100 Industrial Town Cibitung, slated to start operations in the second quarter of 2027. The partnership aims to transfer technology to Dharma Polimetal and generate a new revenue growth engine while leveraging Minth Group’s network of more than 80 global automotive brands.","tags":["Joint Venture","Business Expansion","Capital & Funding","Production & Operations","Bullish"],"title":"Dharma Polimetal (DRMA) forms joint venture with Minth Group to expand EV component business","sector":"consumer-cyclicals","source":"https://emitennews.com/news/bentuk-usaha-patungan-drma-perluas-bisnis-ev-via-mitra-global","symbols":["DRMA.JK"],"dimension":{"future":1,"dividend":0,"ownership":0,"technical":0,"valuation":0,"financials":0,"management":0,"sustainability":0},"thumbnail":"https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789513739.png?25119ab","timestamp":"2026-09-16T06:30:00","sub_sector":["automobiles-components"]}', '2026-09-17 06:49:25.547472+00', '2026-09-17 06:49:25.547472+00', '0a2bebac-66e4-4d03-8239-b7aeed47405d', 9, '2026-09-16 06:30:00+00', false, null, null, null, 0, 'PASS', null), ('c88f7de9-f84a-4dd3-bde9-71883e8af506', 'https://emitennews.com/news/ironi-praktik-gcg-pasar-hukum-saham-smra', 'Irony of GCG Practice, Legal Market for SMRA Shares.', 'The property issuer Summarecon Agung (SMRA) faced a serious corporate‑governance scandal after its president director Adrianto Pitojo Adhi was arrested in a KPK operation, prompting criticism of its GCG practices. The market punished the stock, which fell 13.25% (44 points) to Rp288 per share after opening at Rp328 and touching a high of Rp330 and a low of Rp284. Over the past year the share price has corrected 37.12% (170 points) from Rp458, while the company’s market capitalisation stands at Rp4.75 trillion with a price‑earnings ratio of 7.98. In the first half of 2026, revenue declined 7.18% YoY to Rp4.25 trillion, net profit dropped 33.98% YoY to Rp332.39 billion, total assets rose 7.72% to Rp41.30 trillion, and a cash dividend of Rp82.54 billion (Rp5 per share) was declared for FY 2025.', 'https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789518563.jpeg?25119ab', '2026-09-16 07:30:00+00', 'properties-real-estate', ARRAY['properties-real-estate'], ARRAY['SMRA.JK'], ARRAY['Executive Changes','Risk & Compliance','Dividend Announcement','Market Sentiment','Financial Metrics','Bearish'], '{"future":0,"dividend":0,"ownership":0,"technical":1,"valuation":2,"financials":2,"management":2,"sustainability":0}', '{"body":"The property issuer Summarecon Agung (SMRA) faced a serious corporate‑governance scandal after its president director Adrianto Pitojo Adhi was arrested in a KPK operation, prompting criticism of its GCG practices. The market punished the stock, which fell 13.25% (44 points) to Rp288 per share after opening at Rp328 and touching a high of Rp330 and a low of Rp284. Over the past year the share price has corrected 37.12% (170 points) from Rp458, while the company’s market capitalisation stands at Rp4.75 trillion with a price‑earnings ratio of 7.98. In the first half of 2026, revenue declined 7.18% YoY to Rp4.25 trillion, net profit dropped 33.98% YoY to Rp332.39 billion, total assets rose 7.72% to Rp41.30 trillion, and a cash dividend of Rp82.54 billion (Rp5 per share) was declared for FY 2025.","tags":["Executive Changes","Risk & Compliance","Dividend Announcement","Market Sentiment","Financial Metrics","Bearish"],"title":"Irony of GCG Practice, Legal Market for SMRA Shares.","sector":"properties-real-estate","source":"https://emitennews.com/news/ironi-praktik-gcg-pasar-hukum-saham-smra","symbols":["SMRA.JK"],"dimension":{"future":0,"dividend":0,"ownership":0,"technical":1,"valuation":2,"financials":2,"management":2,"sustainability":0},"thumbnail":"https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789518563.jpeg?25119ab","timestamp":"2026-09-16T07:30:00","sub_sector":["properties-real-estate"]}', '2026-09-17 06:49:25.547472+00', '2026-09-17 06:49:25.547472+00', '0a2bebac-66e4-4d03-8239-b7aeed47405d', 8, '2026-09-16 07:30:00+00', false, null, null, null, 0, 'PASS', null), ('ca2989a9-7113-4dd8-acf2-66e4cf664f14', 'https://emitennews.com/news/ifii-jadwal-dividen-interim-simak-lengkapnya', 'Indonesia Fibreboard (IFII) Announces Interim Dividend of Rp5 per Share and Schedule', 'Indonesia Fibreboard (IFII) announced its interim dividend for the 2026 fiscal year, allocating a total of Rp47.06 billion. The payout represents roughly 60 % of the first‑half 2026 net profit of Rp78.12 billion and translates to an interim dividend of Rp5 per share. The dividend schedule specifies cum dividend for the regular market and negotiation on 28 September 2026, ex dividend for the regular market and negotiation on 29 September 2026, cum dividend for the cash market on 30 September 2026, ex dividend for the cash market on 1 October 2026, with the recording date set for 30 September 2026 at 16:00 WIB and payment on 15 October 2026. As of 30 June 2026, Indonesia Fibreboard (IFII) reported retained earnings of Rp453.72 billion and total accumulated equity of approximately Rp1.4 trillion.', 'https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789698660.jpg?25119ab', '2026-09-18 09:32:00+00', 'basic-materials', ARRAY['basic-materials'], ARRAY['IFII.JK'], ARRAY['Dividend Announcement','Financial Metrics','Bullish'], '{"future":0,"dividend":0,"ownership":0,"technical":0,"valuation":0,"financials":0,"management":0,"sustainability":0}', '{"body":"Indonesia Fibreboard (IFII) announced its interim dividend for the 2026 fiscal year, allocating a total of Rp47.06 billion. The payout represents roughly 60 % of the first‑half 2026 net profit of Rp78.12 billion and translates to an interim dividend of Rp5 per share. The dividend schedule specifies cum dividend for the regular market and negotiation on 28 September 2026, ex dividend for the regular market and negotiation on 29 September 2026, cum dividend for the cash market on 30 September 2026, ex dividend for the cash market on 1 October 2026, with the recording date set for 30 September 2026 at 16:00 WIB and payment on 15 October 2026. As of 30 June 2026, Indonesia Fibreboard (IFII) reported retained earnings of Rp453.72 billion and total accumulated equity of approximately Rp1.4 trillion.","tags":["Dividend Announcement","Financial Metrics","Bullish"],"title":"Indonesia Fibreboard (IFII) Announces Interim Dividend of Rp5 per Share and Schedule","sector":"basic-materials","source":"https://emitennews.com/news/ifii-jadwal-dividen-interim-simak-lengkapnya","symbols":["IFII.JK"],"dimension":{"future":0,"dividend":0,"ownership":0,"technical":0,"valuation":0,"financials":0,"management":0,"sustainability":0},"thumbnail":"https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789698660.jpg?25119ab","timestamp":"2026-09-18T09:32:00","sub_sector":["basic-materials"]}', '2026-09-18 07:01:14.175403+00', '2026-09-18 07:01:14.175403+00', '82361f38-7a9a-4de9-b049-ff9f9010f2d4', 2, '2026-09-18 09:32:00+00', false, null, null, null, 0, 'PASS', null), ('cab669d4-9f0a-4ef9-bb91-715cc754202d', 'https://www.idxchannel.com/market-news/induk-frisian-flag-bakal-jadi-pengendali-baru-ultrajaya-ultj-begini-prospeknya', 'Induk Frisian Flag  Bakal Jadi Pengendali Baru Ultrajaya (ULTJ), Begini Prospeknya', 'Advertisement IDX Channel Market news Induk Frisian Flag Bakal Jadi Pengendali Baru Ultrajaya (ULTJ), Begini Prospeknya Market news Desi Angriani 19/09/2026 10:33 WIB PT Frisian Flag Indonesia (FFI) akan menjadi bagian dari grup ULTJ. Induk Frisian Flag Bakal Jadi Pengendali Baru Ultrajaya (ULTJ), Begini Prospeknya (Foto: dok Ultrajaya) A A A IDXChannel - Induk Frisian Flag, FrieslandCampina akan menjadi pengendali baru PT Ultra Jaya Milk Industry & Trading Company Tbk (ULTJ) seiring kerja sama strategis yang diumumkan oleh perseroan. Sementara itu, PT Frisian Flag Indonesia (FFI) akan menjadi bagian dari grup ULTJ. Untuk merealisasikan transaksi tersebut, ULTJ berencana menggelar rights issue sekitar 7,9 miliar saham baru dengan harga pelaksanaan Rp2.150 per saham. Baca Juga: Frisian Flag Masuk, Ultrajaya (ULTJ) Siap Tebar Dividen Spesial Dana dan saham hasil aksi korporasi tersebut akan digunakan untuk mengakuisisi 100 persen saham FFI dengan nilai transaksi sekitar Rp14,6 triliun. Dalam skema rights issue, pengendali ULTJ akan mengalihkan haknya kepada pemegang saham FFI, yakni FrieslandCampina International Holding BV, Blue Waves Group Ventures Pte Ltd, dan PT Bahtera Wiraniaga Internusa. Ketiganya akan mengambil bagian dalam rights issue melalui mekanisme pemasukan saham (inbreng). Baca Juga: Saham Ultrajaya (ULTJ) Melejit 42 Persen Imbas Kabar Frisian Flag Jadi Pemilik Baru Setelah transaksi rampung, FrieslandCampina diperkirakan menjadi pengendali baru ULTJ dengan kepemilikan sekitar 28,95-30,81 persen. Dengan perubahan pengendalian tersebut, FrieslandCampina akan melaksanakan penawaran tender wajib (mandatory tender offer). Halaman : 1 2 3 4 Your browser does not support the audio tag. LISTEN SHARE Follow Saluran Whatsapp IDX Channel untuk Update Berita Ekonomi Follow Follow Berita IDX Channel di Google News TAG: Ultrajaya ULTJ FrieslandCampina Pengendali baru Rights Issue Tim Editor Desi Angriani Reporter Desi Angriani Editor Berita Rekomendasi Ultra Voucher (UVCR) Mau Gelar Rights Issue, Terbitkan 200 Juta Saham Baru Berita Terkait Frisian Flag Masuk, Ultrajaya (ULTJ) Siap Tebar Dividen Spesial 18/09/2026 18:45 WIB Saham Ultrajaya (ULTJ) Melejit 42 Persen Imbas Kabar Frisian Flag Jadi Pemilik Baru 18/09/2026 14:56 WIB Induk Frisian Flag Bakal Jadi Pengendali Baru Ultrajaya (ULTJ) 18/09/2026 14:40 WIB BAJA Kantongi Restu OJK untuk Gelar Rights Issue Rp450 Miliar 18/09/2026 14:05 WIB Nawasena Caplok 66,58 Persen Saham IDEA, Siap Jadi Pengendali Baru 16/09/2026 12:06 WIB Leyand (LAPD) Gelar Rights Issue, Pengendali Siap Inbreng Saham 13/09/2026 17:00 WIB Berita Lainnya Induk Frisian Flag Bakal Jadi Pengendali Baru Ultrajaya (ULTJ), Begini Prospeknya 19/09/2026 10:33 WIB Harga Emas di Pegadaian Kompak Naik, Antam 1 Gram Tembus Rp2,66 Juta 19/09/2026 09:44 WIB Aset KB Bank Tumbuh 12,71 Persen Jadi Rp86,11 Triliun di Awal 2026 19/09/2026 09:21 WIB Pembiayaan Bermasalah Pindar Didominasi Kelompok Usia 19-34 Tahun 19/09/2026 08:58 WIB Kemenhaj Rancang Anggaran 2027 Lebih Realistis 19/09/2026 08:53 WIB Pendapatan Negara Tumbuh 25,4 Persen, Belanja APBN Tembus Rp2.295,7 Triliun 19/09/2026 08:34 WIB Advertisement Advertisement Populer Berita Utama Haji Isam Resmi Caplok Bayan, Saham BYAN, JARR hingga TEBE Terbang Rebalancing FTSE, Saham BSDE hingga SCMA Tertekan di Menit Akhir Nasib Saham Summarecon (SMRA) usai Presdir Ditangkap KPK, Masih Menarik? 10 Saham Top Gainer Perdagangan Jumat 18 September 2026, Ada BYAN hingga CAMP Minat Investasi Emas Meningkat, HSBC Indonesia Hadirkan Reksa Dana Syariah Induk Frisian Flag Bakal Jadi Pengendali Baru Ultrajaya (ULTJ), Begini Prospeknya Harga Emas di Pegadaian Kompak Naik, Antam 1 Gram Tembus Rp2,66 Juta Demutualisasi Bergulir, OJK Batasi Kepemilikan Saham Bursa Efek Maksimal 5 Persen Aset KB Bank Tumbuh 12,71 Persen Jadi Rp86,11 Triliun di Awal 2026 Intip Deretan Saham Raup Cuan Selama Sepekan, SEMA Pimpin Top Gainers', 'https://img.idxchannel.com/media/500/images/idx/2026/09/19/Ultrajaya.jpg', '2026-09-19 03:35:44.731+00', null, null, ARRAY['ULTJ'], null, null, null, '2026-09-19 03:35:45.319407+00', '2026-09-19 03:35:46.153+00', null, null, '2026-09-19 03:35:44.731+00', false, 'IPO_RIGHTS_ISSUE', 'PT Frisian Flag Indonesia (FFI) akan menjadi bagian dari grup ULTJ.', 'https://www.idxchannel.com/', null, 'PASS', null), ('ce59b4f2-ea41-4f4b-9f0c-6d59071fc385', 'https://emitennews.com/news/saham-fca-ini-melejit-ara-disuspensi-bei-secara-tiba-tiba-kenapa', 'Saham FCA Ini Melejit ARA & Disuspensi BEI Secara Tiba-Tiba, Kenapa?', 'Sempat jadi Youth Researcher Asian Development Bank (ADB) Youth for Asia 2021; berlanjut menjabat sebagai… Memulai karir jurnalistik di e-bursa.com sebagai Reporter (2008-2013), Media Relations (2013-2015),… : 0 Ilustrasi suspensi saham. Foto: EmitenNews. EmitenNews.com - Bursa Efek Indonesia (BEI) baru saja menjatuhkan suspensi perdagangan saham PT Indah Prakasa Sentosa Tbk. (INPS) di seluruh pasar sejak dimulainya Sesi IV Periodic Call Auction pada Kamis siang, 17 September 2026. Padahal, saham yang tercatat di Papan Pemantauan Khusus (FCA) ini baru saja melejit hingga membentur Auto Reject Atas (ARA) pada perdagangan intraday pukul 12.00 WIB. Berdasarkan pantauan, INPS melesat ke level Rp1.065 per saham atau naik Rp95 (+9,79%) pada penutupan perdagangan tengah hari ini, Kamis (17/9). Saham emiten Penyimpanan & Distribusi Migas tersebut dibuka di Rp970 dan menyentuh level tertinggi intraday di Rp1.065 hingga akhirnya disuspensi BEI secara tiba-tiba. Usut deminusut, Penghentian perdagangan tersebut ternyata tertuang dalam Pengumuman Bursa No. Peng-SPT-00008/BEI.PP1/09-2026 tanggal 17 September 2026. BEI menyebut langkah penghentian perdagangan saham INPS tersebut berkaitan dengan Peraturan Bursa No. I-X mengenai penempatan pencatatan efek bersifat ekuitas pada Papan Pemantauan Khusus. INPS menjadi satu-satunya perusahaan tercatat dalam pengumuman tersebut yang memenuhi kriteria dimaksud, yakni kriteria III.1.5, dan telah berada di Papan Pemantauan Khusus selama lebih dari satu tahun berturut-turut. Dalam aturan tersebut, perusahaan tercatat yang memenuhi kriteria tertentu dan telah berada di papan FCA lebih dari satu tahun dapat dikenakan suspensi perdagangan. BEI menyatakan penghentian sementara tersebut dilakukan dalam rangka menjaga perdagangan efek yang teratur, wajar, dan efisien. Bursa juga meminta para pihak yang berkepentingan untuk mencermati keterbukaan informasi yang disampaikan oleh INPS. Saat ini INPS menyandang dua Notasi Khusus yakni, E - Laporan keuangan terakhir menunjukkan ekuitas negatif dan X - Efek Bersifat Ekuitas Dalam Pemantauan. Siapkan PMTHMETD, Ultra Voucher (UVCR) Kuatkan Modal Kembangkan Bisnis Haji Isam Masuk, Low Tuck Kwong Rintis BYAN dari Bisnis Kontraktor Sugeng dan Rudy Perkuat Mitrabahtera (MBSS), Ini Posisinya Usai RUPSLB Nextier Jualan MGLV Lagi, Volume 7 Juta Unit, Harga Setara Pertalite Induk Frisian Flag Caplok Ultrajaya (ULTJ), Saham Langsung Melesat! Saham Big Cap Runtuh di Sesi I (18/9), Ternyata Asing Net Sell Rp1,14T Haji Isam Masuk, Low Tuck Kwong Rintis BYAN dari Bisnis Kontraktor Dibeking 4 Klien Kakap, Saham Prajogo Tembus Top 10 MSCI Small Cap Cuma 3, Ini Saham Indonesia yang Masuk Indeks High Dividend Yield MSCI Kejar Free Float, Yupi Indo (YUPI) Siapkan 4 Opsi, Salah Satunya ESOP Belum Bagikan Dividen, Venteny Fortuna (VTNY) Ungkap Fokusnya Bukan Sekadar Formalitas, Intip Ketatnya Penjurian EmitenNews Awards! Copyright 2026 emitennews.com All rights reserved', 'https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789636814.jpg?25119ab', '2026-09-18 13:42:44.742+00', null, null, ARRAY['INPS'], null, null, null, '2026-09-18 13:42:45.31459+00', '2026-09-18 13:42:46.543+00', null, null, '2026-09-18 13:42:44.742+00', false, 'SUSPENSION_DELISTING', 'Bursa Efek Indonesia (BEI) baru saja menjatuhkan suspensi perdagangan saham PT Indah Prakasa Sentosa Tbk. (INPS) di seluruh pasar sejak Kamis Siang (17/9/2026).', null, null, 'PASS', null), ('cf162ca0-bafc-4b49-9e6b-3a2c25d31fd7', 'https://emitennews.com/news/outlook-byan-kena-pangkas-moodys-dari-stabil-ke-negatif', 'Outlook BYAN Kena Pangkas Moody’s, Dari Stabil ke Negatif', 'Content Writer Radar Cirebon TV 2023, Reporter Legislatif DPRD Kota Cirebon 2023-2025. : 0 Aktivitas pengangkutan di pelabuhan batu bara Bayan Resources. Foto - Dok Bloomberg Technoz EmitenNews.com - Lembaga pemeringkat Moody’s Ratings memangkas outlook PT Bayan Resources Tbk (BYAN) dari stabil menjadi negatif. Meski begitu, Moody’s masih mempertahankan peringkat Corporate Family Rating (CFR) emiten tambang batubara tersebut di level Ba1. Asisten VP Moody’s Ratings, Anthony Prayugo mengatakan bahwa perubahan outlook menjadi negatif dipicu ketidakpastian regulasi terkait persetujuan kuota produksi tahunan dari pemerintah Indonesia. Sehingga memicu kondisi Bayan force majeure atas kewajiban pasokan batu bara pada 14 September 2026. “Prospek negatif ini mencerminkan ketidakpastian regulasi terkait alokasi kuota produksi, yang menyebabkan Bayan menyatakan keadaan kahar (force majeure). Jika tidak segera diselesaikan, ketidakpastian ini dapat membatasi produksi dan membebani pendapatan," kata Anthony. Tanpa kuota yang direvisi, produksi BYAN diperkirakan bakal anjlok menjadi sekitar 39 juta metrik ton (MT) pada tahun 2026 dari sekitar 68 juta MT pada tahun 2025. Sekalipun kuota pada akhirnya ditingkatkan, ketidakpastian seputar proses persetujuan tahunan mengurangi visibilitas terhadap kemampuan BYAN untuk mengamankan alokasi produksi yang dibutuhkan untuk memperluas produksi menuju kapasitas penuhnya sekitar 80 juta MT dalam beberapa tahun mendatang. “Jika permintaan perusahaan untuk revisi kuota tidak disetujui, kami memperkirakan EBITDA Bayan akan menurun menjadi sekitar $700 juta pada tahun 2026 dari sekitar $1,1 miliar pada tahun 2025, terutama karena volume penjualan yang jauh lebih rendah,” jelas Anthony. Begitu pun jika produksi tetap berada di kisaran 39 juta MT pada tahun 2027, maka diperkirakan EBITDA akan terus ambles menjadi sekitar $400 juta-$500 juta, berdasarkan asumsi harga jual rata-rata kami sebesar $48/MT, yang berada di bawah harga realisasi yang diharapkan untuk tahun 2026. Dalam skenario ini, pendapatan akan tetap jauh di bawah ekspektasi kami sebelumnya sekitar $1 miliar per tahun, yang mengasumsikan pertumbuhan produksi berkelanjutan menuju kapasitas produksi perusahaan sebesar 80 juta MT. Terlepas dari tekanan-tekanan tersebut, metrik kredit BYAN masih cenderung kuat. Moody’s memperkirakan BYAN akan mendanai belanja modal untuk peningkatan kapasitas produksi dan perluasan infrastruktur. Karena itu, Moody’s memperkirakan rasio utang/EBITDA yang disesuaikan oleh Moody’s akan tetap di bawah 0,5x selama dua tahun ke depan. Siapkan PMTHMETD, Ultra Voucher (UVCR) Kuatkan Modal Kembangkan Bisnis Haji Isam Masuk, Low Tuck Kwong Rintis BYAN dari Bisnis Kontraktor Sugeng dan Rudy Perkuat Mitrabahtera (MBSS), Ini Posisinya Usai RUPSLB Nextier Jualan MGLV Lagi, Volume 7 Juta Unit, Harga Setara Pertalite Induk Frisian Flag Caplok Ultrajaya (ULTJ), Saham Langsung Melesat! Saham Big Cap Runtuh di Sesi I (18/9), Ternyata Asing Net Sell Rp1,14T Haji Isam Masuk, Low Tuck Kwong Rintis BYAN dari Bisnis Kontraktor Dibeking 4 Klien Kakap, Saham Prajogo Tembus Top 10 MSCI Small Cap Cuma 3, Ini Saham Indonesia yang Masuk Indeks High Dividend Yield MSCI Kejar Free Float, Yupi Indo (YUPI) Siapkan 4 Opsi, Salah Satunya ESOP Belum Bagikan Dividen, Venteny Fortuna (VTNY) Ungkap Fokusnya Bukan Sekadar Formalitas, Intip Ketatnya Penjurian EmitenNews Awards! Copyright 2026 emitennews.com All rights reserved', 'https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789696622.jpg?25119ab', '2026-09-18 13:42:17.658+00', null, null, ARRAY['BYAN'], null, null, null, '2026-09-18 13:42:18.211823+00', '2026-09-18 13:42:19.003+00', null, null, '2026-09-18 13:42:17.658+00', false, 'SINGLE_STOCK', 'Lembaga pemeringkat Moody’s Ratings memangkas outlook PT Bayan Resources Tbk (BYAN) dari stabil menjadi negatif.', null, null, 'PASS', null), ('f4293d60-73ac-4938-8574-95b62f9e16d1', 'https://emitennews.com/news/wujud-akuisisi-10-miliar-saham-byan-oleh-emiten-haji-isam-makin-jelas', 'Wujud Akuisisi 10 Miliar Saham BYAN Oleh Emiten Haji Isam Makin Jelas', 'Belajar jurnalistik dari koran kampus Identitas, Universitas Hasanuddin Makassar, lalu bergabung dengan… : 0 Pengusaha Andi Syamsuddin Arsyad atau Haji Isam (kanan) dan Low Tuck Kwong. Dok. BYAN/Emitennews. EmitenNews.com - Wujud akuisisi saham PT Bayan Resources Tbk. (BYAN) oleh pengusaha batu bara Andi Syamsuddin Arsyad atau Haji Isam makin jelas. Rencana pengalihan 10.000.000.500 saham emiten milik Low Tuck Kwong dan Elaine Low kepada PT Jhonlin Baratama, perusahaan yang terafiliasi dengan Haji Isam itu, telah ditandatangani oleh kedua pihak pada Rabu (16/9/2026). Sejak beberapa waktu lalu isu itu, sudah mengemuka tetapi dibantah para pihak. Konglomerat Low Tuck Kwong dan Elaine Low menandatangani Perjanjian Jual Beli Saham Bersyarat (Conditional Share Sale and Purchase Agreement) dengan Jhonlin Baratama selaku pembeli pada 16 September 2026. Direktur Bayan Resources Jenny Quantero mengatakan, perjanjian tersebut telah ditandatangani oleh kedua pihak pada tanggal tersebut. “Bapak Low Tuck Kwong dan Ibu Elaine Low telah menandatangani Perjanjian Jual Beli Saham Bersyarat pada tanggal 16 September 2026,” ujar Jenny Quantero dalam keterbukaan informasi BEI, Rabu (16/9/2026). Mengacu pada perjanjian itu, sebanyak 10.000.000.500 saham biasa BYAN akan dialihkan kepada Jhonlin Baratama. Namun, transaksi belum dapat diselesaikan karena masih menunggu terpenuhinya sejumlah kondisi pendahuluan yang telah disepakati kedua pihak. Jika seluruh persyaratan tersebut terpenuhi dan transaksi rampung, Jhonlin Baratama akan menguasai lebih dari 10 miliar saham BYAN tersebut. Seperti diketahui Jhonlin Baratama merupakan perusahaan yang bergerak di bidang kontraktor pertambangan dan produksi batu bara yang berbasis di Tanah Bumbu, Kalimantan Selatan. Perusahaan tersebut merupakan bagian dari Jhonlin Group milik Haji Isam. Apapun rencana pengalihan saham ini menjadi perkembangan baru di tengah kabar mengenai potensi masuknya kelompok usaha Haji Isam ke BYAN. Sebelumnya, pasar diramaikan informasi mengenai rencana akuisisi atau pengambilalihan saham BYAN oleh konsorsium yang dikaitkan dengan Haji Isam. Satu hal, transaksi 10 miliar saham tersebut belum final. Kesepakatan yang diteken masih bersifat bersyarat dan penyelesaiannya bergantung pada pemenuhan seluruh kondisi pendahuluan yang telah ditetapkan. Di pasar modal, saham BYAN ditutup menguat 1,54% ke level Rp11.525 per saham pada perdagangan Kamis (17/9/2026). Namun, dalam sepekan terakhir saham BYAN masih terkoreksi 12,02%. Secara year to date (YTD), saham BYAN juga tercatat turun 26,59 persen. *** Siapkan PMTHMETD, Ultra Voucher (UVCR) Kuatkan Modal Kembangkan Bisnis Haji Isam Masuk, Low Tuck Kwong Rintis BYAN dari Bisnis Kontraktor Sugeng dan Rudy Perkuat Mitrabahtera (MBSS), Ini Posisinya Usai RUPSLB Nextier Jualan MGLV Lagi, Volume 7 Juta Unit, Harga Setara Pertalite Induk Frisian Flag Caplok Ultrajaya (ULTJ), Saham Langsung Melesat! Saham Big Cap Runtuh di Sesi I (18/9), Ternyata Asing Net Sell Rp1,14T Haji Isam Masuk, Low Tuck Kwong Rintis BYAN dari Bisnis Kontraktor Dibeking 4 Klien Kakap, Saham Prajogo Tembus Top 10 MSCI Small Cap Cuma 3, Ini Saham Indonesia yang Masuk Indeks High Dividend Yield MSCI Kejar Free Float, Yupi Indo (YUPI) Siapkan 4 Opsi, Salah Satunya ESOP Belum Bagikan Dividen, Venteny Fortuna (VTNY) Ungkap Fokusnya Bukan Sekadar Formalitas, Intip Ketatnya Penjurian EmitenNews Awards! Copyright 2026 emitennews.com All rights reserved', 'https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/emitennews-02/uploads/news/thumb_1789653623.jpeg?25119ab', '2026-09-18 13:42:27.959+00', null, null, ARRAY['BYAN'], null, null, null, '2026-09-18 13:42:28.507295+00', '2026-09-18 13:42:29.675+00', null, null, '2026-09-18 13:42:27.959+00', false, 'CORPORATE_ACTION', 'Rencana pengalihan 10.000.000.500 saham emiten milik Low Tuck Kwong dan Elaine Low kepada PT Jhonlin Baratama, telah ditandatangani oleh kedua pihak pada Rabu', null, null, 'PASS', null), ('f7d1a58f-f07e-4aca-ae86-31348cc4a4bf', 'https://keuangan.kontan.co.id/news/transaksi-digital-btn-melonjak-146-bank-mandiri-catat-332-miliar-transaksi', 'Transaksi Digital BTN Melonjak 146%, Bank Mandiri Catat 3,32 Miliar Transaksi', 'Keuangan Diikuti 4